(212179, 12219, 5044, '<td valign="top">Nice job hiding him. I think I see him in the top left window? Aside from that, I find the colours are a little too red. and that the contrast is maybe a little high. Nice composition though.</td>', 'Nice job hiding him. I think I see him in the top left window? Aside from that, I find the colours are a little too red. and that the contrast is maybe a little high. Nice composition though.', '2003-02-10 12:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
