(212204, 12158, 1041, '<td valign="top">meets the challenge.  to be honest, i''m not very inspired by the photo.  the background is somewhat drab, and has some of the surroundings intruding (bottom left and top).  i wonder if you could''ve framed this so that these things were excluded.  also, and this is just my personal preference, i like to see photos using the maximum width/height to allow the viewer to look at the details more.</td>', 'meets the challenge.  to be honest, i''m not very inspired by the photo.  the background is somewhat drab, and has some of the surroundings intruding (bottom left and top).  i wonder if you could''ve framed this so that these things were excluded.  also, and this is just my personal preference, i like to see photos using the maximum width/height to allow the viewer to look at the details more.', '2003-02-10 12:48:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(212205, 12255, 5753, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Would be perfect if character was a little less obvious IMO. 8</td>', 'Very nice.  Would be perfect if character was a little less obvious IMO. 8', '2003-02-10 12:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(212206, 12249, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  i like the bright colors of the grass and the shed.  they make the photo.  i wonder if you could''ve framed the shot so that those colors dominate the photo more, maybe a vertical crop that still includes the person hiding behind the large shrub.  good job on mostly excluding the sky.</td>', 'challenge met.  i like the bright colors of the grass and the shed.  they make the photo.  i wonder if you could''ve framed the shot so that those colors dominate the photo more, maybe a vertical crop that still includes the person hiding behind the large shrub.  good job on mostly excluding the sky.', '2003-02-10 12:50:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(212207, 12194, 6349, '<td valign="top">This is by far my favorite photo for this challenge.  It is the only one in my opinion that is a high quality photograph in terms of composition, colors, dof, etc. that actually HIDES a person.  Great job.</td>', 'This is by far my favorite photo for this challenge.  It is the only one in my opinion that is a high quality photograph in terms of composition, colors, dof, etc. that actually HIDES a person.  Great job.', '2003-02-10 12:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(212208, 12138, 6392, '<td valign="top">My favorite version of this idea. You avoided the problem of conflicting colors with B/W. Good job</td>', 'My favorite version of this idea. You avoided the problem of conflicting colors with B/W. Good job', '2003-02-10 12:52:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(212209, 12172, 6349, '<td valign="top">great job.  This is one of my favorites this challenge.  One of maybe 5 pictures that are excellent pictures while at the same time actually following the challenge rules of HIDING a person.  Great job.</td>', 'great job.  This is one of my favorites this challenge.  One of maybe 5 pictures that are excellent pictures while at the same time actually following the challenge rules of HIDING a person.  Great job.', '2003-02-10 12:52:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(212210, 12107, 5753, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, and challenge met. 10</td>', 'Beautiful shot, and challenge met. 10', '2003-02-10 12:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(212211, 12071, 6504, '<td valign="top">This might or might not be a Waldo photo, but with the look on his face, Waldo could be somewhere and he knows where Waldo is, and is not telling.</td>', 'This might or might not be a Waldo photo, but with the look on his face, Waldo could be somewhere and he knows where Waldo is, and is not telling.', '2003-02-10 12:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(212212, 12157, 6349, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this picture.  The composition with the water at the very top is excellent and ads slightly to the hidden nature of the person.  The DOF is right on and the colors are excellent.  I would have voted this higher had the challenge not implied that the person be hidden.  This person is definetely not hidden, although at least they aren''t the subject of the shot like some of the others.  I like that you titled it big bird.  I can see how someone would perhaps think they were a bird.  Still not hidden to me.  Maybe you could have changed that by limiting the dof in the back, but then the picture wouldnt be as good.  Anyway, a great picture, forget the challenge; it made you take a great shot and thats what matters!</td>', 'I absolutely love this picture.  The composition with the water at the very top is excellent and ads slightly to the hidden nature of the person.  The DOF is right on and the colors are excellent.  I would have voted this higher had the challenge not implied that the person be hidden.  This person is definetely not hidden, although at least they aren''t the subject of the shot like some of the others.  I like that you titled it big bird.  I can see how someone would perhaps think they were a bird.  Still not hidden to me.  Maybe you could have changed that by limiting the dof in the back, but then the picture wouldnt be as good.  Anyway, a great picture, forget the challenge; it made you take a great shot and thats what matters!', '2003-02-10 12:56:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(212213, 12127, 5753, '<td valign="top">Would improve this shot by zooming closer and lighting the pieces uniformly.  In this case the glare of certain pieces is a little annoying.  Great colours though. 7</td>', 'Would improve this shot by zooming closer and lighting the pieces uniformly.  In this case the glare of certain pieces is a little annoying.  Great colours though. 7', '2003-02-10 12:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(212215, 12193, 2567, '<td valign="top">Nice shot but I don''t think n the spirit of the challenge.</td>', 'Nice shot but I don''t think n the spirit of the challenge.', '2003-02-10 12:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(212220, 12160, 6349, '<td valign="top">One of 5 or so pictures that are good photographs and actually meet the challenge.  I love the composition and the reflection of the window panes on the textured floor.  The person is well hidden and an interesting profile!  I would have moved the potted plant slightly left (or your body) so that its silhouette wasn''t cut off and perhaps blurred the view out the window.  Also, the bright bit of light neat the person is annoying because it calls the eye there to the hidden part and sort of looks like reflection off of their watch.  I think the area would be better solid black.  That can be very easily spot edited out later.  Great job!</td>', 'One of 5 or so pictures that are good photographs and actually meet the challenge.  I love the composition and the reflection of the window panes on the textured floor.  The person is well hidden and an interesting profile!  I would have moved the potted plant slightly left (or your body) so that its silhouette wasn''t cut off and perhaps blurred the view out the window.  Also, the bright bit of light neat the person is annoying because it calls the eye there to the hidden part and sort of looks like reflection off of their watch.  I think the area would be better solid black.  That can be very easily spot edited out later.  Great job!', '2003-02-10 13:01:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(212224, 12093, 6349, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo. I like the choice of tones and love the contrast.  The background in particular is so soft and misty and the bridge is hard and rough and pops out nicely.  The person is well hidden, although I knew exactly where to look to find them.  I would have moved them somewhere to the side of the bridge or maybe lying in the snowpiles on the middle left or under the bridge.  Great job!</td>', 'Lovely photo. I like the choice of tones and love the contrast.  The background in particular is so soft and misty and the bridge is hard and rough and pops out nicely.  The person is well hidden, although I knew exactly where to look to find them.  I would have moved them somewhere to the side of the bridge or maybe lying in the snowpiles on the middle left or under the bridge.  Great job!', '2003-02-10 13:04:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(212227, 12085, 6349, '<td valign="top">I like this alot.  This is the only photo I liked where the person was hidden by just showing their leg because it blends in with the tecture and limbs of the tree so well.  B+W was an excellent choice.  Very interesting perspective.  Great job!</td>', 'I like this alot.  This is the only photo I liked where the person was hidden by just showing their leg because it blends in with the tecture and limbs of the tree so well.  B+W was an excellent choice.  Very interesting perspective.  Great job!', '2003-02-10 13:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(212228, 12294, 5753, '<td valign="top">A little too warm, and still looking for Waldo...</td>', 'A little too warm, and still looking for Waldo...', '2003-02-10 13:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(212229, 12193, 3102, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t seem to adhere to the challenge requirements very well...</td>', 'This doesn''t seem to adhere to the challenge requirements very well...', '2003-02-10 13:06:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(212231, 12167, 6349, '<td valign="top">I almost submitted a similar phot.  I like this very much.  Good job of hiding the person as the challenge called for while still taking a good natural photo.  B+W was a good choice.</td>', 'I almost submitted a similar phot.  I like this very much.  Good job of hiding the person as the challenge called for while still taking a good natural photo.  B+W was a good choice.', '2003-02-10 13:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
