(212238, 12203, 6349, '<td valign="top">good job hiding the person but I wouldn''t have put them so much in the center.  i dont like the sepia tone.  I would have moved a bit so that the cross had a cleared background because I think it is an important aspect, perhaps the main focal point, of your image and it seems conflicted.</td>', 'good job hiding the person but I wouldn''t have put them so much in the center.  i dont like the sepia tone.  I would have moved a bit so that the cross had a cleared background because I think it is an important aspect, perhaps the main focal point, of your image and it seems conflicted.', '2003-02-10 13:09:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(212240, 12258, 2567, '<td valign="top">Terrific idea.  I find the white showing through the other two holes very distracting.  Wish they could have been covered in.  Good luck.</td>', 'Terrific idea.  I find the white showing through the other two holes very distracting.  Wish they could have been covered in.  Good luck.', '2003-02-10 13:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(212241, 12275, 6349, '<td valign="top">I like this picture a lot.  The composition and lightining is superb and the border you chose goes so well with the double yellow lines.  The image is beautiful and one of my favorites so far on this site but unfortunately the person is not that well hidden at all.  They are sooooo easy to find.  Oh well, forget the challenge, it got you to take an awesome picture and thats what really matters!</td>', 'I like this picture a lot.  The composition and lightining is superb and the border you chose goes so well with the double yellow lines.  The image is beautiful and one of my favorites so far on this site but unfortunately the person is not that well hidden at all.  They are sooooo easy to find.  Oh well, forget the challenge, it got you to take an awesome picture and thats what really matters!', '2003-02-10 13:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(212242, 12256, 6349, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  the people aren''t that well hidden and there are a few of them.  I think the picture would be better without them anyway, cropping off the right side and straightening it a bit.  Nice job!</td>', 'Very nice shot.  the people aren''t that well hidden and there are a few of them.  I think the picture would be better without them anyway, cropping off the right side and straightening it a bit.  Nice job!', '2003-02-10 13:12:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(212244, 12219, 6349, '<td valign="top">Hes in the bottom right in front of the tree.  Or is he driving the car.  You can''t have two waldo''s!  jk.  I like this a lot and you did the best job of hiding waldo I think.  I like the red and blue tones on everything.  I would scratch the blue border though, its going to far with it and overpowers the others light blues in the picture.</td>', 'Hes in the bottom right in front of the tree.  Or is he driving the car.  You can''t have two waldo''s!  jk.  I like this a lot and you did the best job of hiding waldo I think.  I like the red and blue tones on everything.  I would scratch the blue border though, its going to far with it and overpowers the others light blues in the picture.', '2003-02-10 13:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(212245, 12071, 6284, '<td valign="top">cute but not hidden in the photo</td>', 'cute but not hidden in the photo', '2003-02-10 13:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(212246, 12116, 6349, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture.  Good title.  Is that Waldo or a group of camels?!   Lol.  They aren''t that well hidden where they are but it doesn''t matter, the pictures is really nice.  I like the slight vignetting.  Nice job.</td>', 'Lovely picture.  Good title.  Is that Waldo or a group of camels?!   Lol.  They aren''t that well hidden where they are but it doesn''t matter, the pictures is really nice.  I like the slight vignetting.  Nice job.', '2003-02-10 13:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(212247, 12209, 6349, '<td valign="top">Awesome picture.  The person, of course, is not well hidden at all, but the wonderful texture of the trees make up for it.  This is worthy of a frame even if it doesnt do well in this particular challenge.  Great job!</td>', 'Awesome picture.  The person, of course, is not well hidden at all, but the wonderful texture of the trees make up for it.  This is worthy of a frame even if it doesnt do well in this particular challenge.  Great job!', '2003-02-10 13:17:28.000000', NULL, 1),
