(212339, 12255, 6370, '<td valign="top">excellent shot.  one my 2 favourites for this week.  the pink tone adds something here - not sure what I like about it, but I do.</td>', 'excellent shot.  one my 2 favourites for this week.  the pink tone adds something here - not sure what I like about it, but I do.', '2003-02-10 14:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
