(212341, 12212, 4967, '<td valign="top">Nice repetition here, and good use of the challenge.  Might have liked some brighter colors, but I''m not sure...  I maybe would have cropped some off the top.  I like the shadows though.</td>', 'Nice repetition here, and good use of the challenge.  Might have liked some brighter colors, but I''m not sure...  I maybe would have cropped some off the top.  I like the shadows though.', '2003-02-10 14:42:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(212342, 12167, 4967, '<td valign="top">Excellent job of incorporating the challenge into a beautiful photo.  I like the repetition of trees, and "Waldo" fits very nicely into the photo.  Very nice job!  -10-</td>', 'Excellent job of incorporating the challenge into a beautiful photo.  I like the repetition of trees, and "Waldo" fits very nicely into the photo.  Very nice job!  -10-', '2003-02-10 14:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(212347, 12095, 6479, '<td valign="top">great photo i love you!!!</td>', 'great photo i love you!!!', '2003-02-10 14:47:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(212348, 12053, 6450, '<td valign="top">Good job, i really like the colaboration of the staues and dummies. the brown really gives it a stone texture!</td>', 'Good job, i really like the colaboration of the staues and dummies. the brown really gives it a stone texture!', '2003-02-10 14:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(212352, 12215, 6392, '<td valign="top">I would expect better lighting and less noise, but anyway it is my favorite picture of the challenge.</td>', 'I would expect better lighting and less noise, but anyway it is my favorite picture of the challenge.', '2003-02-10 14:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(212353, 12100, 4967, '<td valign="top">I can see what you were going for to fit the challenge but I don''t really know if it works.  Technically this photo could be imroved, especially by cropping.  There is way too much empty space on both the right and the left sides, and the girl is very centered which isn''t usually desirable in photography.    Also the fact that just the slightest part of her head is cut off is very bothersome.  Cute girl, and cute stuffed animal, but the photo needs some work.</td>', 'I can see what you were going for to fit the challenge but I don''t really know if it works.  Technically this photo could be imroved, especially by cropping.  There is way too much empty space on both the right and the left sides, and the girl is very centered which isn''t usually desirable in photography.    Also the fact that just the slightest part of her head is cut off is very bothersome.  Cute girl, and cute stuffed animal, but the photo needs some work.', '2003-02-10 14:49:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(212359, 12274, 4967, '<td valign="top">Is this an Iowa license plate from Sexton Ford?  &lt;GRIN&gt;  Good use of incorporating Waldo''s red and white stripes into the photo, it works well with the red and white of the car.  Also the red background is nice.  Maybe you could have tried going without the tennis shoe, possibly with a white sock?  the grey of the tennis shoot and the bright spots on it detract from the photo IMHO.  But it''s a nice photo, composition wise, and it fits the challenge.  Good luck!  -Talya</td>', 'Is this an Iowa license plate from Sexton Ford?  <GRIN>  Good use of incorporating Waldo''s red and white stripes into the photo, it works well with the red and white of the car.  Also the red background is nice.  Maybe you could have tried going without the tennis shoe, possibly with a white sock?  the grey of the tennis shoot and the bright spots on it detract from the photo IMHO.  But it''s a nice photo, composition wise, and it fits the challenge.  Good luck!  -Talya', '2003-02-10 14:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(212374, 12094, 4501, '<td valign="top">In mymopinion this does not fit the challenge</td>', 'In mymopinion this does not fit the challenge', '2003-02-10 15:02:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(212380, 12284, 4967, '<td valign="top">Nice job of keeping your eye away from "waldo''s" legs.  What a great catch with that deer ;-)  Very cute photo, and nicely done with the contrasts as well as the composition.  I really like it!  Also great use of the challenge.  -10-</td>', 'Nice job of keeping your eye away from "waldo''s" legs.  What a great catch with that deer ;-)  Very cute photo, and nicely done with the contrasts as well as the composition.  I really like it!  Also great use of the challenge.  -10-', '2003-02-10 15:03:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(212383, 12210, 4967, '<td valign="top">Looks comfotable :-)  Excellent lighting job for what looks to be an indoor scene, very nicely done.  Very busy photo, but it gets you where you want to go.  Might have tried to hide baby "waldo" a little more effectively, but it''s cute.</td>', 'Looks comfotable :-)  Excellent lighting job for what looks to be an indoor scene, very nicely done.  Very busy photo, but it gets you where you want to go.  Might have tried to hide baby "waldo" a little more effectively, but it''s cute.', '2003-02-10 15:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(212386, 12095, 4967, '<td valign="top">That is one hungry Waldo!  Look at all those empty spaces in the machine!  LOL... nice reflection... it looks like there is a grey film over the entire photo, not sure what caused this...  Not extremely attractive photo, this might have worked better as a vertical picture, as everything in it is vertical.  Good job of getting "waldo" into the photo.</td>', 'That is one hungry Waldo!  Look at all those empty spaces in the machine!  LOL... nice reflection... it looks like there is a grey film over the entire photo, not sure what caused this...  Not extremely attractive photo, this might have worked better as a vertical picture, as everything in it is vertical.  Good job of getting "waldo" into the photo.', '2003-02-10 15:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(212388, 12077, 4967, '<td valign="top">Cute!  I would have liked the top row of bleachers to look straight in the photo, but nice job getting "Waldo" in there!  I like the extra pattern of the fence and the fact that you didn''t just shoot the field straight on, you put something in front of it.  Makes for a much more interesting picture!  I''m giving it a -9- only because it looks slightly tilted to me.  Still a WONDERFUL job!  Good luck!</td>', 'Cute!  I would have liked the top row of bleachers to look straight in the photo, but nice job getting "Waldo" in there!  I like the extra pattern of the fence and the fact that you didn''t just shoot the field straight on, you put something in front of it.  Makes for a much more interesting picture!  I''m giving it a -9- only because it looks slightly tilted to me.  Still a WONDERFUL job!  Good luck!', '2003-02-10 15:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
