(212541, 12232, 1024, '<td valign="top">This photo is well done in many ways.  The composition is dynamic.  The exposure is so well done that you can read the inscription on the white tomb without blowing out your high lights in other places.  The shadow and the foot are what makes this photograph in this particular challenge.  I would like to see it without them just as a well done photograph.</td>', 'This photo is well done in many ways.  The composition is dynamic.  The exposure is so well done that you can read the inscription on the white tomb without blowing out your high lights in other places.  The shadow and the foot are what makes this photograph in this particular challenge.  I would like to see it without them just as a well done photograph.', '2003-02-10 16:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(212542, 12117, 6444, '<td valign="top">good job</td>', 'good job', '2003-02-10 16:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(212543, 12167, 3032, '<td valign="top">Is that a face behind the lamp post?<br/>Good composition, nice B&amp;W, excellent exposure.</td>', 'Is that a face behind the lamp post?Good composition, nice B&W, excellent exposure.', '2003-02-10 16:02:53.000000', NULL, 1),
