(212953, 12250, 2000, '<td valign="top">Definite high cuteness factor here.  Good photo properties, and the lighting seems to help blend the child into the surroundings.</td>', 'Definite high cuteness factor here.  Good photo properties, and the lighting seems to help blend the child into the surroundings.', '2003-02-10 21:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(212963, 12163, 5044, '<td valign="top">My wife says her students claim there are no ethical issues in engineering. Nice shot. I''m not sure about the shelf, though.</td>', 'My wife says her students claim there are no ethical issues in engineering. Nice shot. I''m not sure about the shelf, though.', '2003-02-10 21:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(212967, 12071, 5044, '<td valign="top">Very cute kid, and great portrait, but I don''t see the challenge in this picture.</td>', 'Very cute kid, and great portrait, but I don''t see the challenge in this picture.', '2003-02-10 21:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(212976, 12294, 1647, '<td valign="top">Well done - it took me a minute to find the "real person".  The photo looks a little yellow to me (ie: whitebalance problem).  Also it looks like you struggled with a light source that was too strong / close.  I think sorting the colour out would have really helped this image since the creatures have so many colours amongst themselves.  I like the crop - except perhaps the only creature at the top - it looks like you went straight through it''s eyes.  Well done on a good shot.</td>', 'Well done - it took me a minute to find the "real person".  The photo looks a little yellow to me (ie: whitebalance problem).  Also it looks like you struggled with a light source that was too strong / close.  I think sorting the colour out would have really helped this image since the creatures have so many colours amongst themselves.  I like the crop - except perhaps the only creature at the top - it looks like you went straight through it''s eyes.  Well done on a good shot.', '2003-02-10 21:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(212980, 12249, 1647, '<td valign="top">You have hid the person well (is that a real person or a print).  Colour and focus are fine, although the image isn''t real exciting in any way.</td>', 'You have hid the person well (is that a real person or a print).  Colour and focus are fine, although the image isn''t real exciting in any way.', '2003-02-10 21:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(212982, 12233, 4388, '<td valign="top">very creative!</td>', 'very creative!', '2003-02-10 21:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(212983, 12121, 5044, '<td valign="top">Good hiding, but unfortunately this pic is just too out of focus. If you were going for DOF, you should have included more foreground.</td>', 'Good hiding, but unfortunately this pic is just too out of focus. If you were going for DOF, you should have included more foreground.', '2003-02-10 21:23:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(212985, 12242, 5044, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, this picture is just too out of focus.</td>', 'Unfortunately, this picture is just too out of focus.', '2003-02-10 21:24:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(212986, 12222, 3942, '<td valign="top">The original might be a nice shot, but I can''t see this in your submision. IMHO this photo is much too small and unfortunately the JPEG compression artefacts are completely destroying the impression. You can submit a file size up to 150KB (your shot has only 15KB)!  Doing so will eliminate or decrease the compression artefacts...</td>', 'The original might be a nice shot, but I can''t see this in your submision. IMHO this photo is much too small and unfortunately the JPEG compression artefacts are completely destroying the impression. You can submit a file size up to 150KB (your shot has only 15KB)!  Doing so will eliminate or decrease the compression artefacts...', '2003-02-10 21:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(212989, 12221, 1647, '<td valign="top">Ok, you almost beat me.  I had given up and then spotted the forehead at the last minute - well done in that respect.  The magazines on the left are distracting, and the plant is a little distracting as well.  Lighting is ok, but perhaps a little fill from the left might have balanced things out.  The border compliments the couch well.</td>', 'Ok, you almost beat me.  I had given up and then spotted the forehead at the last minute - well done in that respect.  The magazines on the left are distracting, and the plant is a little distracting as well.  Lighting is ok, but perhaps a little fill from the left might have balanced things out.  The border compliments the couch well.', '2003-02-10 21:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(212992, 12083, 1647, '<td valign="top">It looks like Cindy fell over.  I like the composition, and the colour &amp; exposure are pretty good.</td>', 'It looks like Cindy fell over.  I like the composition, and the colour & exposure are pretty good.', '2003-02-10 21:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(212995, 12167, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  It is very moody in black and white.  I''m 99% certain I can see the person - subtle yet also nicely centred.  I like the way the road leads you into the photo, whilst the building and nearest light pole provide points of interest.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice shot.  It is very moody in black and white.  I''m 99% certain I can see the person - subtle yet also nicely centred.  I like the way the road leads you into the photo, whilst the building and nearest light pole provide points of interest.  Well done.', '2003-02-10 21:30:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(212999, 12251, 5044, '<td valign="top">I see two people on that bridge. Otherwise nice photo.</td>', 'I see two people on that bridge. Otherwise nice photo.', '2003-02-10 21:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(213000, 12186, 1647, '<td valign="top">I don''t think you hid the person well enough!  I would have cropped the left edge, and moved the finger in appropriately.  Also, it looks like you have a lot of dust / hair on the lens of your camera (or are these scratches in the board).  Unfortunately I really don''t think this meets the challenge and I don''t understand the significance of the maze / title.</td>', 'I don''t think you hid the person well enough!  I would have cropped the left edge, and moved the finger in appropriately.  Also, it looks like you have a lot of dust / hair on the lens of your camera (or are these scratches in the board).  Unfortunately I really don''t think this meets the challenge and I don''t understand the significance of the maze / title.', '2003-02-10 21:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(213001, 12250, 5044, '<td valign="top">What a cutie. Nice capture. Good sharpness. Great idea. ;-) Unfortunately not so original. (I have one too). Hope to see you on the podium. LOL</td>', 'What a cutie. Nice capture. Good sharpness. Great idea. ;-) Unfortunately not so original. (I have one too). Hope to see you on the podium. LOL', '2003-02-10 21:33:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(213003, 12233, 1647, '<td valign="top">If you are who I think you are, you love photographing your face.  I like the concept (presumably printed card with a cutout) - it''s a very fun photo.  And the person is hidden in an abstract kind of way.  Thie lighting is a bit too different between the other characters and yourself, but perhaps this was deliberate.  Well done.</td>', 'If you are who I think you are, you love photographing your face.  I like the concept (presumably printed card with a cutout) - it''s a very fun photo.  And the person is hidden in an abstract kind of way.  Thie lighting is a bit too different between the other characters and yourself, but perhaps this was deliberate.  Well done.', '2003-02-10 21:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(213005, 12198, 1647, '<td valign="top">Waldo stands out when wearing a bright blue cost in a brown and green forest.  I think it''s a nice photo but slightly off topic for the challenge.  I do like the colours and the focus is fairly good.</td>', 'Waldo stands out when wearing a bright blue cost in a brown and green forest.  I think it''s a nice photo but slightly off topic for the challenge.  I do like the colours and the focus is fairly good.', '2003-02-10 21:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(213006, 12107, 5044, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Excellent composition. Colours are great.Person could stand to be a little less obvious, but still a 10. One of my picks for top 3.</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Excellent composition. Colours are great.Person could stand to be a little less obvious, but still a 10. One of my picks for top 3.', '2003-02-10 21:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(213008, 12122, 5044, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. Nice idea. Nice soft mood. One of my favs this week. 10</td>', 'Excellent shot. Nice idea. Nice soft mood. One of my favs this week. 10', '2003-02-10 21:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(213009, 12181, 1647, '<td valign="top">Eddie spotted - bottom left, with a big feather coming out of his hair.  It''s a lovely picture and you have met the challenge in terms of hiding the person.  I''m always a sucker for silohuetted objects.  The focus and sharpness of the image is very good (they are often blurred from long exposure) and the composition is good - well done.</td>', 'Eddie spotted - bottom left, with a big feather coming out of his hair.  It''s a lovely picture and you have met the challenge in terms of hiding the person.  I''m always a sucker for silohuetted objects.  The focus and sharpness of the image is very good (they are often blurred from long exposure) and the composition is good - well done.', '2003-02-10 21:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(213010, 12167, 5044, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot. Very well composed. Wonderful use of BW. Building in the back is a little distracting, but still OK. Person is very well hidden. One of my picks for top 3. 10</td>', 'Beautiful shot. Very well composed. Wonderful use of BW. Building in the back is a little distracting, but still OK. Person is very well hidden. One of my picks for top 3. 10', '2003-02-10 21:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(213011, 12093, 5044, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture, but there is something very surreal about the contrast between the bridge and the background. Also, person is well hidden. 9</td>', 'I really like this picture, but there is something very surreal about the contrast between the bridge and the background. Also, person is well hidden. 9', '2003-02-10 21:43:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(213013, 12228, 1647, '<td valign="top">Technically the shallow depth of field works well.  Focus is good and lighting is fairly good.  Composition is nice.  Why did you ruin it with a Bin Laden image?  The "Where''s Bin Laden" joke is old.</td>', 'Technically the shallow depth of field works well.  Focus is good and lighting is fairly good.  Composition is nice.  Why did you ruin it with a Bin Laden image?  The "Where''s Bin Laden" joke is old.', '2003-02-10 21:47:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(213030, 12116, 6413, '<td valign="top">I couldn''t find a person in your pic - please let me know if there is one. It is a really nice picture though.</td>', 'I couldn''t find a person in your pic - please let me know if there is one. It is a really nice picture though.', '2003-02-10 22:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(213032, 12171, 6413, '<td valign="top">I love this - once you see the person you can''t miss them! I love how the footprints lead right to them. The color and shape of the tree against the blue sky is wonderful.</td>', 'I love this - once you see the person you can''t miss them! I love how the footprints lead right to them. The color and shape of the tree against the blue sky is wonderful.', '2003-02-10 22:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
