(213073, 12053, 6328, '<td valign="top">Beautiful body parts! Very creative touch.</td>', 'Beautiful body parts! Very creative touch.', '2003-02-10 22:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(213079, 12151, 6328, '<td valign="top">Wow, lovely color with the umbrella''s, the lights shimmering off the water, you on the balcony. . .  Great photo.</td>', 'Wow, lovely color with the umbrella''s, the lights shimmering off the water, you on the balcony. . .  Great photo.', '2003-02-10 22:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(213082, 12309, 6328, '<td valign="top">Good thought. nice lighting.</td>', 'Good thought. nice lighting.', '2003-02-10 22:53:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(213086, 12262, 1647, '<td valign="top">Technically the photo is ok - good focus.  I''m curious as to why the person is upside down - presumably to make it harder to identify.</td>', 'Technically the photo is ok - good focus.  I''m curious as to why the person is upside down - presumably to make it harder to identify.', '2003-02-10 22:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(213095, 12297, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice work - although I suspect you might get a DQ request or two.  The trees really do look like the legs of a person.  The photo has a kind of surreal quality to it.</td>', 'Nice work - although I suspect you might get a DQ request or two.  The trees really do look like the legs of a person.  The photo has a kind of surreal quality to it.', '2003-02-10 23:03:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(213096, 12133, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting of the teddy bears.  They are very clear.  Focus is good.</td>', 'I like the lighting of the teddy bears.  They are very clear.  Focus is good.', '2003-02-10 23:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(213098, 12092, 1647, '<td valign="top">Good focus and nice composition, however it doesn''t seem to meet the challenge unless you are suggesting the child is looking forward to reading "Where''s Waldo" - even if so it''s still a little too far from the topic though.</td>', 'Good focus and nice composition, however it doesn''t seem to meet the challenge unless you are suggesting the child is looking forward to reading "Where''s Waldo" - even if so it''s still a little too far from the topic though.', '2003-02-10 23:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(213102, 12102, 1647, '<td valign="top">Good work - lot''s of different toys, plenty of different colours.  The person is well situated and well proportioned.  Focus is good although the image is perhaps a little bit under exposed / under lit.  A very good photo though.</td>', 'Good work - lot''s of different toys, plenty of different colours.  The person is well situated and well proportioned.  Focus is good although the image is perhaps a little bit under exposed / under lit.  A very good photo though.', '2003-02-10 23:07:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(213104, 12053, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice work - black and white is essential in hiding the person here I believe.  Focus and composition are good, although the image does feel slightly lop-sided - too much on the right but not enough to appear deliberate.</td>', 'Nice work - black and white is essential in hiding the person here I believe.  Focus and composition are good, although the image does feel slightly lop-sided - too much on the right but not enough to appear deliberate.', '2003-02-10 23:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(213110, 12283, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like the colour and composition of this photo.  It''s very real, but also interesting and colourful.  My only complaint (and it''s minor) is what looks like a tag above the big teddy on the right.  Also, the bed frame isn''t quite balanced, which would have given the photo good structure.  Well done though.</td>', 'I like the colour and composition of this photo.  It''s very real, but also interesting and colourful.  My only complaint (and it''s minor) is what looks like a tag above the big teddy on the right.  Also, the bed frame isn''t quite balanced, which would have given the photo good structure.  Well done though.', '2003-02-10 23:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(213112, 12075, 3080, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  I really like the area you chose for photographing.  The angle and framing/cropping are very nice.  There seems to be a haze over the photo, but I am wondering if that is from all the glare and reflections.  Not a big deal at all.  I think that the focus SEEMS soft due to lighting conditions.  At least, I would think that was the reason.  The glasses on the counter look a little soft and the bucket in the background.  This looks like a tricky shot, and I think you did a nice job with it.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice shot.  I really like the area you chose for photographing.  The angle and framing/cropping are very nice.  There seems to be a haze over the photo, but I am wondering if that is from all the glare and reflections.  Not a big deal at all.  I think that the focus SEEMS soft due to lighting conditions.  At least, I would think that was the reason.  The glasses on the counter look a little soft and the bucket in the background.  This looks like a tricky shot, and I think you did a nice job with it.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-02-10 23:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(213114, 12107, 3080, '<td valign="top">Beautiful interpretation of the challenge.  Great focus and clarity.  The angle and framing/cropping is excelent.  I love the negative space here.  The colors are simply beautiful and the silhouette is great.  What more can I say?  I think it was VERY beneficial to this shot that you put the stairs over to the right side.  Great job. Good luck in the challenge. 10</td>', 'Beautiful interpretation of the challenge.  Great focus and clarity.  The angle and framing/cropping is excelent.  I love the negative space here.  The colors are simply beautiful and the silhouette is great.  What more can I say?  I think it was VERY beneficial to this shot that you put the stairs over to the right side.  Great job. Good luck in the challenge. 10', '2003-02-10 23:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(213115, 12092, 3080, '<td valign="top">Well, not exactly hidden, but definately a cutie.  The lighting on the babies head, and the womans face is just a bit harsh.  Nice job of blurring the background.  This has a snapshot feel to it, but it is cute.  I think that the angle and framing/cropping are ok.  color is also good.  good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Well, not exactly hidden, but definately a cutie.  The lighting on the babies head, and the womans face is just a bit harsh.  Nice job of blurring the background.  This has a snapshot feel to it, but it is cute.  I think that the angle and framing/cropping are ok.  color is also good.  good luck in the challenge.', '2003-02-10 23:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(213117, 12144, 3080, '<td valign="top">I get it.  Took me a sec, but I see the "hidden" person now.  This is a neat shot.  The focus is a little hard on the eyes, but I realize it was done on purpose, and done well.  The color is nice.  The black coat blends in a bit with the dark background, but I don''t feel that that harms the photo in any way.  Overall you have done a good job with this effect.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I get it.  Took me a sec, but I see the "hidden" person now.  This is a neat shot.  The focus is a little hard on the eyes, but I realize it was done on purpose, and done well.  The color is nice.  The black coat blends in a bit with the dark background, but I don''t feel that that harms the photo in any way.  Overall you have done a good job with this effect.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-02-10 23:33:40.000000', NULL, 1),
