(213671, 12279, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very patient set up.  The real waldo, too!  Middle plane of focus may get you some focus comments.  Did you do this for a reason (maybe to help "hide" your Waldo?)?  But your background is so plain, Waldo still stands out plainly.  Maybe more coins???  7 Swash</td>', 'Very patient set up.  The real waldo, too!  Middle plane of focus may get you some focus comments.  Did you do this for a reason (maybe to help "hide" your Waldo?)?  But your background is so plain, Waldo still stands out plainly.  Maybe more coins???  7 Swash', '2003-02-11 16:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(213672, 12144, 5869, '<td valign="top">Like the Ghost image</td>', 'Like the Ghost image', '2003-02-11 16:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(213673, 12181, 5869, '<td valign="top">Misdirection great !!!!!!</td>', 'Misdirection great !!!!!!', '2003-02-11 16:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(213674, 12219, 5869, '<td valign="top">and.....</td>', 'and.....', '2003-02-11 16:00:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(213675, 12151, 5869, '<td valign="top">Got it ...between the blue and orange right?  Wow how long is it going to take me to vote for all these if I have to spend so long spotting the traget?<br/>Grat night scene though ...Ill give it 8</td>', 'Got it ...between the blue and orange right?  Wow how long is it going to take me to vote for all these if I have to spend so long spotting the traget?Grat night scene though ...Ill give it 8', '2003-02-11 16:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(213676, 12097, 5869, '<td valign="top">Didn''t I just see this ?</td>', 'Didn''t I just see this ?', '2003-02-11 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(213677, 12186, 5869, '<td valign="top">Don''t get it at all</td>', 'Don''t get it at all', '2003-02-11 16:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(213678, 12225, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very bright, eye catchy view.  Could be a little over-exposed in the whiter areas.  I honestly don''t see your waldo at all.  Could it be the sort of smiley faces in the red crystals???  I never thought I''d say - too much color, but in this case, it''s a bit overwhelming.  6 Swash</td>', 'Very bright, eye catchy view.  Could be a little over-exposed in the whiter areas.  I honestly don''t see your waldo at all.  Could it be the sort of smiley faces in the red crystals???  I never thought I''d say - too much color, but in this case, it''s a bit overwhelming.  6 Swash', '2003-02-11 16:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(213679, 12142, 5869, '<td valign="top">Great idea ...how did you do it pure white out.  It works well</td>', 'Great idea ...how did you do it pure white out.  It works well', '2003-02-11 16:04:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(213680, 12215, 5869, '<td valign="top">Lego ...how versatile it really is...</td>', 'Lego ...how versatile it really is...', '2003-02-11 16:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(213681, 12209, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, Waldo found hidden, but not too hidden.  Not alot of visual impact.  Glare is at a minimum, nicely done.  Color seems pretty good.  7 Swash</td>', 'Nice photo, Waldo found hidden, but not too hidden.  Not alot of visual impact.  Glare is at a minimum, nicely done.  Color seems pretty good.  7 Swash', '2003-02-11 16:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(213682, 12094, 5869, '<td valign="top">Or where has Waldo Bean?  No idea</td>', 'Or where has Waldo Bean?  No idea', '2003-02-11 16:05:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(213683, 12107, 5869, '<td valign="top">Love it.  Fantastic light, graet silhouette, superb subject.  Surely they didn''t just happen to be standing there ?</td>', 'Love it.  Fantastic light, graet silhouette, superb subject.  Surely they didn''t just happen to be standing there ?', '2003-02-11 16:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(213684, 12281, 1570, '<td valign="top">where is the hidden person? oh, now i see this face! changing my score, too!</td>', 'where is the hidden person? oh, now i see this face! changing my score, too!', '2003-02-11 16:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(213685, 12148, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute title.  Am I seeing shadows on the fur (on purpose to look like claws? or am I just putting my visual spin on it.  Interesting upsidedown subject, image flipped, you did that for the claws/hands shadows, right?  The white fur looses definition in places due to glare/exposure issues, darker setting might have been better for both the fur and the shadows (well, maybe?)  7 Swash</td>', 'Cute title.  Am I seeing shadows on the fur (on purpose to look like claws? or am I just putting my visual spin on it.  Interesting upsidedown subject, image flipped, you did that for the claws/hands shadows, right?  The white fur looses definition in places due to glare/exposure issues, darker setting might have been better for both the fur and the shadows (well, maybe?)  7 Swash', '2003-02-11 16:09:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(213687, 12193, 1005, '<td valign="top">I am assuming your "waldo" is the person getting the shoe shine?  Too many people to be really clear on this.  Photo is a little dim, colorwise and focus isn''t fully sharp.  6 Swash</td>', 'I am assuming your "waldo" is the person getting the shoe shine?  Too many people to be really clear on this.  Photo is a little dim, colorwise and focus isn''t fully sharp.  6 Swash', '2003-02-11 16:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(213690, 12224, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice hidding job!  I like this very much challenge-wise.  The color of the plant seems a tad dim to me, but it could be the plant.  9 Swash</td>', 'Nice hidding job!  I like this very much challenge-wise.  The color of the plant seems a tad dim to me, but it could be the plant.  9 Swash', '2003-02-11 16:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(213694, 12203, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  my initial reaction to this photo was that i didn''t like the color.  but ... the more i look at it, the more i like it.  it makes an otherwise not very exciting scene look more different and therefore makes me look twice.  it''s also a crisp photo with nice tonalities.  :)</td>', 'challenge met.  my initial reaction to this photo was that i didn''t like the color.  but ... the more i look at it, the more i like it.  it makes an otherwise not very exciting scene look more different and therefore makes me look twice.  it''s also a crisp photo with nice tonalities.  :)', '2003-02-11 16:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(213696, 12258, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met ... although it is rather easy to spot the guy, he doesn''t look too happy to be there.  nice colorful photo, the background behind the other openings is a little distracting (none of which you had any control over unless a different shooting angle would''ve avoided showing that).</td>', 'challenge met ... although it is rather easy to spot the guy, he doesn''t look too happy to be there.  nice colorful photo, the background behind the other openings is a little distracting (none of which you had any control over unless a different shooting angle would''ve avoided showing that).', '2003-02-11 16:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(213697, 12127, 1005, '<td valign="top">Ooohhh, I see the girl''s face along the lower right/center of the photo.  The glare on several pieces is a bit severe, esp. the one lower left/center.  Very jumbled scene.  7 Swash</td>', 'Ooohhh, I see the girl''s face along the lower right/center of the photo.  The glare on several pieces is a bit severe, esp. the one lower left/center.  Very jumbled scene.  7 Swash', '2003-02-11 16:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(213700, 12121, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  i''m sure you''ve already got some comments about focus so i''ll skip that.  i like the columns lined up to the right, they give a nice feeling of depth to the photo.  overall, the colors are rather muted, partially because it seems to be an overcast day.  some color adjustments could''ve livened that up a little bit.</td>', 'challenge met.  i''m sure you''ve already got some comments about focus so i''ll skip that.  i like the columns lined up to the right, they give a nice feeling of depth to the photo.  overall, the colors are rather muted, partially because it seems to be an overcast day.  some color adjustments could''ve livened that up a little bit.', '2003-02-11 16:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(213703, 12284, 1005, '<td valign="top">Oooh, I see.  The fake deer head seems to be slightly out of focus, hard to see.  The legs below the branch are the dead give away.  (Suggestion - crop off the legs, the branch could have been the trunk of the tree)  7 Swash</td>', 'Oooh, I see.  The fake deer head seems to be slightly out of focus, hard to see.  The legs below the branch are the dead give away.  (Suggestion - crop off the legs, the branch could have been the trunk of the tree)  7 Swash', '2003-02-11 16:24:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(213705, 12096, 1005, '<td valign="top">A little grainy, esp. the pole in front of the window and the other stuff that is similarly colored (to a lesser degree).  Maybe a different ISO setting?  (If available)  Waldo fairly well hidden, nice idea.  7 Swash</td>', 'A little grainy, esp. the pole in front of the window and the other stuff that is similarly colored (to a lesser degree).  Maybe a different ISO setting?  (If available)  Waldo fairly well hidden, nice idea.  7 Swash', '2003-02-11 16:25:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(213707, 12194, 1005, '<td valign="top">In front/beside the "shack"?  Very small waldo.  Low visual impact shot.  6 Swash</td>', 'In front/beside the "shack"?  Very small waldo.  Low visual impact shot.  6 Swash', '2003-02-11 16:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(213708, 12145, 1005, '<td valign="top">Is that a shot glass?  (looks more like a 10 oz beer glass)  Glaring background is just not a good thing.  Neat idea for the reflection, I like that.  6 Swash</td>', 'Is that a shot glass?  (looks more like a 10 oz beer glass)  Glaring background is just not a good thing.  Neat idea for the reflection, I like that.  6 Swash', '2003-02-11 16:29:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(213710, 12261, 1005, '<td valign="top">Har d har har.....Whats with the green mesh around the beer??  Except for the humor factor, not alot of interest going on.  (Maybe Waldo''s box needs a hole to feed the beer through? or a face drawn on the box???)  6 Swash</td>', 'Har d har har.....Whats with the green mesh around the beer??  Except for the humor factor, not alot of interest going on.  (Maybe Waldo''s box needs a hole to feed the beer through? or a face drawn on the box???)  6 Swash', '2003-02-11 16:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(213712, 12237, 1005, '<td valign="top">Sly one!  Cute shot.  Good disguise.  (Deep reading materiel)  Nice fingers.<br/>Well taken photo (yours seems better than the kitty shot, which seems slightly out of focus).  Cute cat.  8 Swash</td>', 'Sly one!  Cute shot.  Good disguise.  (Deep reading materiel)  Nice fingers.Well taken photo (yours seems better than the kitty shot, which seems slightly out of focus).  Cute cat.  8 Swash', '2003-02-11 16:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(213713, 12267, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat picture, but is the statue your "waldo"?  I don''t see anybody else.  It''s a bit dark.  7 Swash</td>', 'Neat picture, but is the statue your "waldo"?  I don''t see anybody else.  It''s a bit dark.  7 Swash', '2003-02-11 16:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(213714, 12107, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  it''s not exactly difficult to find the person (a photographer?  looks like he/she is using a tripod), but the person blends in well, and the staircase structure against the sunset is just really nice and well exposed.  one of my favorites so far :)</td>', 'challenge met.  it''s not exactly difficult to find the person (a photographer?  looks like he/she is using a tripod), but the person blends in well, and the staircase structure against the sunset is just really nice and well exposed.  one of my favorites so far :)', '2003-02-11 16:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(213715, 12203, 1005, '<td valign="top">Waldo in the middle back yard.  Why sepia?  Well taken photo, very clear.  7 Swash</td>', 'Waldo in the middle back yard.  Why sepia?  Well taken photo, very clear.  7 Swash', '2003-02-11 16:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(213716, 12224, 1570, '<td valign="top">this is really nice... i hope that you will explain in your remarks how you did it...</td>', 'this is really nice... i hope that you will explain in your remarks how you did it...', '2003-02-11 16:38:28.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(213717, 12150, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nearly a snowman in a snowstorm!  I see your waldo, on the horizon, 1/3 on the right.  Is that a sled with waldo?   The snow seems to have "fooled" the camera into thinking there is color (my guess).  7 Swash</td>', 'Nearly a snowman in a snowstorm!  I see your waldo, on the horizon, 1/3 on the right.  Is that a sled with waldo?   The snow seems to have "fooled" the camera into thinking there is color (my guess).  7 Swash', '2003-02-11 16:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(213718, 12167, 1041, '<td valign="top">challenge met.  what a beautiful shot.  b&amp;w is perfect here, your eye is just leisurely led through the photo ... and right by the person.  the girl fits well into the shot, not exactly hidden, but not prominent either.  my favorite so far :)</td>', 'challenge met.  what a beautiful shot.  b&w is perfect here, your eye is just leisurely led through the photo ... and right by the person.  the girl fits well into the shot, not exactly hidden, but not prominent either.  my favorite so far :)', '2003-02-11 16:40:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(213719, 12117, 1005, '<td valign="top">Ooohhh the glare!  I cannot tell which figure is your waldo (all are waldo???)  Nice sun rays, but it overwhelms the rest of the shot.  6 Swash</td>', 'Ooohhh the glare!  I cannot tell which figure is your waldo (all are waldo???)  Nice sun rays, but it overwhelms the rest of the shot.  6 Swash', '2003-02-11 16:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(213721, 12080, 1570, '<td valign="top">found him!</td>', 'found him!', '2003-02-11 16:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(213722, 12153, 1005, '<td valign="top">Sillhouetted you as waldo?  Lack of definition and general interest, sorry.  6 Swash</td>', 'Sillhouetted you as waldo?  Lack of definition and general interest, sorry.  6 Swash', '2003-02-11 16:43:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(213723, 12124, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute shot!  Jumbled, but it works well enough for this challenge.  Nice color!  <br/>8 Swash</td>', 'Cute shot!  Jumbled, but it works well enough for this challenge.  Nice color!  8 Swash', '2003-02-11 16:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(213724, 12155, 1041, '<td valign="top">barbara?  terry?  well, anyway.  challenge met.  i like how the legs of the warden kind of match the legs of the giraffe (albeit just 2 instead of 4).  the photo has nice colors and sharpness, too.  no one will be able to complain about the beautiful landscape in the background either ;)</td>', 'barbara?  terry?  well, anyway.  challenge met.  i like how the legs of the warden kind of match the legs of the giraffe (albeit just 2 instead of 4).  the photo has nice colors and sharpness, too.  no one will be able to complain about the beautiful landscape in the background either ;)', '2003-02-11 16:45:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(213725, 12133, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very clear shot, nice color, I see waldo''s eye!  I think I need to take a comment break, nothing''s coming......  (will this do?)  8 Swash</td>', 'Very clear shot, nice color, I see waldo''s eye!  I think I need to take a comment break, nothing''s coming......  (will this do?)  8 Swash', '2003-02-11 16:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(213727, 12194, 1570, '<td valign="top">this is great - technically very nice and fits the challenge perfectly... love the colors and geometric quality... 10</td>', 'this is great - technically very nice and fits the challenge perfectly... love the colors and geometric quality... 10', '2003-02-11 16:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(213729, 12196, 1570, '<td valign="top">i see her all right, but the picture itself is a little too dark...</td>', 'i see her all right, but the picture itself is a little too dark...', '2003-02-11 16:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(213731, 12127, 1570, '<td valign="top">yes, i can.</td>', 'yes, i can.', '2003-02-11 16:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(213733, 12210, 2764, '<td valign="top">Is that a price tag on the kid?? I''ll take it!  How much??? I need some grandchildren...</td>', 'Is that a price tag on the kid?? I''ll take it!  How much??? I need some grandchildren...', '2003-02-11 17:08:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(213734, 12233, 5753, '<td valign="top">Hey, are you the guy who shot "me, and me again!".  <br/>Nice compo!  Very creative, compared to all of those who saw two many reruns of E.T.  Good idea to focus on the eyes.  Some windows are too dark and crooked, but the compo alone is worth a 7.</td>', 'Hey, are you the guy who shot "me, and me again!".  Nice compo!  Very creative, compared to all of those who saw two many reruns of E.T.  Good idea to focus on the eyes.  Some windows are too dark and crooked, but the compo alone is worth a 7.', '2003-02-11 17:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(213736, 12123, 5753, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Nice cut-out.  The yellow balls are too bright, and the border doesn''t help, IMO.</td>', 'Great idea.  Nice cut-out.  The yellow balls are too bright, and the border doesn''t help, IMO.', '2003-02-11 17:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(213737, 12077, 2000, '<td valign="top">I understand why you show the fence in this shot, but it''s really noisy.  This would have worked fine without the fence, given that the person would still be well hidden just with all the seats.</td>', 'I understand why you show the fence in this shot, but it''s really noisy.  This would have worked fine without the fence, given that the person would still be well hidden just with all the seats.', '2003-02-11 17:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(213739, 12071, 2867, '<td valign="top">was this an accidental submission? good pic otherwise</td>', 'was this an accidental submission? good pic otherwise', '2003-02-11 17:20:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(213740, 12071, 2764, '<td valign="top">Way toooo cute! and a great photo! umm whers waldo?? 9</td>', 'Way toooo cute! and a great photo! umm whers waldo?? 9', '2003-02-11 17:20:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(213742, 12175, 2000, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture of the subject matter.  Why on earth do you have so many sneakers?</td>', 'Very nice capture of the subject matter.  Why on earth do you have so many sneakers?', '2003-02-11 17:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
