(213780, 12123, 4517, '<td valign="top">I could be wrong but i think this will be in the top 3. It`s interesting and colourful and meets the challenge well. 10</td>', 'I could be wrong but i think this will be in the top 3. It`s interesting and colourful and meets the challenge well. 10', '2003-02-11 18:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(213783, 12175, 4517, '<td valign="top">Very sharp photo, great dof and good idea.10</td>', 'Very sharp photo, great dof and good idea.10', '2003-02-11 18:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(213787, 12250, 6477, '<td valign="top">great! congrats</td>', 'great! congrats', '2003-02-11 18:14:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(213788, 12198, 1005, '<td valign="top">Not very hidden with that shocking blue jacket!  The colors seem overly saturated, a little helps digi-cams, alot makes it seem unnatural, esp. the greens and reds.  Grey skys, can''t do much about that.  7 Swash</td>', 'Not very hidden with that shocking blue jacket!  The colors seem overly saturated, a little helps digi-cams, alot makes it seem unnatural, esp. the greens and reds.  Grey skys, can''t do much about that.  7 Swash', '2003-02-11 18:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(213789, 12179, 1005, '<td valign="top">Neat effect.  The water fuzzes "waldo" a bit much, but it''s interesting.  I like the golden water.  8 Swash</td>', 'Neat effect.  The water fuzzes "waldo" a bit much, but it''s interesting.  I like the golden water.  8 Swash', '2003-02-11 18:20:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(213791, 12281, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very interesting effect.  Makes me wonder how it was done, I will try to remember to read the notes on this one after the challenge.  Nice color, focus, composition.  The jar, doilie and dual tone background seem clumsy together, esp. the jar and the doilie.  On the other hand, the effect with the face is just too wonderful to mark this down too much.  8 Swash</td>', 'Very interesting effect.  Makes me wonder how it was done, I will try to remember to read the notes on this one after the challenge.  Nice color, focus, composition.  The jar, doilie and dual tone background seem clumsy together, esp. the jar and the doilie.  On the other hand, the effect with the face is just too wonderful to mark this down too much.  8 Swash', '2003-02-11 18:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(213792, 12121, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective shot, but waldo is wayyyy out of the focal area.  Sorry, but I think this is a little overly grey and lacks interest.  5 Swash</td>', 'Nice perspective shot, but waldo is wayyyy out of the focal area.  Sorry, but I think this is a little overly grey and lacks interest.  5 Swash', '2003-02-11 18:28:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(213793, 12160, 1005, '<td valign="top">Ohh, waldo is sillouetted on the right side of the frame, in the room.  With an about 5 seconds to grab the viewer''s attention, this may be a little too hidden.  (I kept looking at the building in the background, but gave up - seeing nothing)  As most of the foreground is sillhouetted, not much to comment on for the picture and the background just confuses the situation.  5 Swash</td>', 'Ohh, waldo is sillouetted on the right side of the frame, in the room.  With an about 5 seconds to grab the viewer''s attention, this may be a little too hidden.  (I kept looking at the building in the background, but gave up - seeing nothing)  As most of the foreground is sillhouetted, not much to comment on for the picture and the background just confuses the situation.  5 Swash', '2003-02-11 18:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(213794, 12170, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice classical type of "Where''s Waldo".  The painting on the level below is a good decoy - was that deliberate or good luck?  It''s an interesting perspective of a building which I''m sure I''ve seen in other submissions before.  Focus is crisp and the way the top level is washed out is interesting.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice classical type of "Where''s Waldo".  The painting on the level below is a good decoy - was that deliberate or good luck?  It''s an interesting perspective of a building which I''m sure I''ve seen in other submissions before.  Focus is crisp and the way the top level is washed out is interesting.  Well done.', '2003-02-11 18:35:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(213795, 12080, 1005, '<td valign="top">Upper window, second from the left.  Good focus and color.  Low interest.  6 Swash</td>', 'Upper window, second from the left.  Good focus and color.  Low interest.  6 Swash', '2003-02-11 18:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(213796, 12180, 1005, '<td valign="top">Easily spotted Waldo.  Nice still life.  Clean carpet!  7 Swash</td>', 'Easily spotted Waldo.  Nice still life.  Clean carpet!  7 Swash', '2003-02-11 18:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(213797, 12229, 1647, '<td valign="top">This photo is very dark.  I''m guessing the person is on the bench behind the tree.  It looks like you have spots on your lens.  Composition is ok and focus seems fine but it''s just too dark to appreciate.</td>', 'This photo is very dark.  I''m guessing the person is on the bench behind the tree.  It looks like you have spots on your lens.  Composition is ok and focus seems fine but it''s just too dark to appreciate.', '2003-02-11 18:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(213799, 12175, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and nice execution.  Composition is very good, lighting is good and the big depth of field works well.  I like this shot for its originality.</td>', 'Nice idea and nice execution.  Composition is very good, lighting is good and the big depth of field works well.  I like this shot for its originality.', '2003-02-11 18:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(213801, 12298, 1647, '<td valign="top">It''s a different take on the challenge.  Technically I like the shot - focus is good, lighting is very good and composition is nice.</td>', 'It''s a different take on the challenge.  Technically I like the shot - focus is good, lighting is very good and composition is nice.', '2003-02-11 18:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(213806, 12117, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but it struggles to meet the challenge.  There are several people in the shot and no idea which one you are talking about.  Having said that, it looks like it was taken in Australia so I might give you a bonus point for being local.</td>', 'Nice photo, but it struggles to meet the challenge.  There are several people in the shot and no idea which one you are talking about.  Having said that, it looks like it was taken in Australia so I might give you a bonus point for being local.', '2003-02-11 18:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(213807, 12091, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute, extremely covered waldo.  Overall, good photo.  In places the satin quilting seems a bit washed out, but not wholly bad.  Why is waldo''s head off to the side?  8 Swash</td>', 'Cute, extremely covered waldo.  Overall, good photo.  In places the satin quilting seems a bit washed out, but not wholly bad.  Why is waldo''s head off to the side?  8 Swash', '2003-02-11 18:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(213808, 12211, 1647, '<td valign="top">It''s a relatively nice photo - I like the composition.  The person isn''t terribly well "hidden".  Colours are nice.  I wonder if the photo would look a bit better if it was rotated slightly anti-clockwise.</td>', 'It''s a relatively nice photo - I like the composition.  The person isn''t terribly well "hidden".  Colours are nice.  I wonder if the photo would look a bit better if it was rotated slightly anti-clockwise.', '2003-02-11 18:47:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(213809, 12063, 1005, '<td valign="top">Title - No clue, I don''t see waldo anywhere.  Nice photo, good color and focus.  Please PM me with waldo''s location in the photo and I''ll bump the score a notch (unless that location is out of the frame).  7 Swash</td>', 'Title - No clue, I don''t see waldo anywhere.  Nice photo, good color and focus.  Please PM me with waldo''s location in the photo and I''ll bump the score a notch (unless that location is out of the frame).  7 Swash', '2003-02-11 18:48:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(213811, 12267, 1647, '<td valign="top">I like this photo - I''m a sucker for wierd statues coming out of the ground (where I live we have the corner of a library coming out of the pavement).  In some ways the birds are distracting because they almost look like defects initially, but I love the colours of the sunset (maybe sunrise).</td>', 'I like this photo - I''m a sucker for wierd statues coming out of the ground (where I live we have the corner of a library coming out of the pavement).  In some ways the birds are distracting because they almost look like defects initially, but I love the colours of the sunset (maybe sunrise).', '2003-02-11 18:51:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(213812, 12155, 1005, '<td valign="top">Well, I think you got "waldo"''s backside.....Nice giraffe shot.  Too bad about the wires.  (Is this a baby?)  A tad heavy glare in the lower left corner and I''m not really crazy about the leg motion, but this seems like a difficult situation, so I''ll go a little easy on you.  7 Swash</td>', 'Well, I think you got "waldo"''s backside.....Nice giraffe shot.  Too bad about the wires.  (Is this a baby?)  A tad heavy glare in the lower left corner and I''m not really crazy about the leg motion, but this seems like a difficult situation, so I''ll go a little easy on you.  7 Swash', '2003-02-11 18:51:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(213813, 12071, 1647, '<td valign="top">That''s a lovely photo but way too far from the challenge topic.  Technically though, composition is great, lighting is wonderful and his expression is great.  The sepia toning type effect works really well.</td>', 'That''s a lovely photo but way too far from the challenge topic.  Technically though, composition is great, lighting is wonderful and his expression is great.  The sepia toning type effect works really well.', '2003-02-11 18:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(213814, 12082, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice prints and shadow.  I like the lower 3/4 of this shot the most and I think that part would stand up better than the inclusion of the horizon.  7 Swash</td>', 'Nice prints and shadow.  I like the lower 3/4 of this shot the most and I think that part would stand up better than the inclusion of the horizon.  7 Swash', '2003-02-11 18:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(213815, 12083, 1005, '<td valign="top">Falling down, I think, behind the white dog.  Far background adds little to this photo.  Kinda cool that the dog is white against the white snow....7 Swash</td>', 'Falling down, I think, behind the white dog.  Far background adds little to this photo.  Kinda cool that the dog is white against the white snow....7 Swash', '2003-02-11 18:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(213816, 12107, 1647, '<td valign="top">I really like the colours of this photo.  Framing is very good (especially the horizon at the bottom edge of the frame).  Well done.</td>', 'I really like the colours of this photo.  Framing is very good (especially the horizon at the bottom edge of the frame).  Well done.', '2003-02-11 18:57:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(213818, 12194, 1647, '<td valign="top">Well done - The person is well hidden and the shot is still interesting.  The man-hole with the cracked ground around it is a great feature.  The shot has texture, patterns and a nice sense of balance.  Focus and exposure are spot on.  Great work.</td>', 'Well done - The person is well hidden and the shot is still interesting.  The man-hole with the cracked ground around it is a great feature.  The shot has texture, patterns and a nice sense of balance.  Focus and exposure are spot on.  Great work.', '2003-02-11 19:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(213820, 12224, 1647, '<td valign="top">I''m not surprised by the admin note at all.  My guess is that the shot was taken through a piece of glass (or similar) with either a well placed reflection or a transparent print.  The effect is really good.  I like the fine black line of the border and the tree is well balanced and interesting to look at.  Good work.</td>', 'I''m not surprised by the admin note at all.  My guess is that the shot was taken through a piece of glass (or similar) with either a well placed reflection or a transparent print.  The effect is really good.  I like the fine black line of the border and the tree is well balanced and interesting to look at.  Good work.', '2003-02-11 19:02:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(213822, 12107, 1005, '<td valign="top">I really love the color of the sunset.  Wonderful!!  The sun through the clouds is a very nice look.  Odd sign.  Is this a look out on purpose?  Just plain wierd on an advertising sign.  Overall, I like this much better than the false Waldos I offered up previously.  I''m going with an 8.  It''s a nice silhouette, great color, challenge met, interest level is middle (not low or really high).</td>', 'I really love the color of the sunset.  Wonderful!!  The sun through the clouds is a very nice look.  Odd sign.  Is this a look out on purpose?  Just plain wierd on an advertising sign.  Overall, I like this much better than the false Waldos I offered up previously.  I''m going with an 8.  It''s a nice silhouette, great color, challenge met, interest level is middle (not low or really high).', '2003-02-11 19:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(213827, 12073, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nope.   Needs a waldo, this is a tease.  (PM me, if I''m wrong)  Low contrast and other than the tease, low interest, too.  5 Swash</td>', 'Nope.   Needs a waldo, this is a tease.  (PM me, if I''m wrong)  Low contrast and other than the tease, low interest, too.  5 Swash', '2003-02-11 19:06:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(213829, 12093, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice photo - it''s almost surreal at the bottom.  The person is well hidden.  Colour is wonderful although I would have preferred it if the border didn''t blend into the photo in spots - perhaps two borders (like adding an inner white border) would have worked.  Great photo though.</td>', 'Nice photo - it''s almost surreal at the bottom.  The person is well hidden.  Colour is wonderful although I would have preferred it if the border didn''t blend into the photo in spots - perhaps two borders (like adding an inner white border) would have worked.  Great photo though.', '2003-02-11 19:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(213832, 12269, 1005, '<td valign="top">Under the truck bed, between the tires.  Focus is good, contrast is strong in places.  Interest moderate to low.  6 Swash</td>', 'Under the truck bed, between the tires.  Focus is good, contrast is strong in places.  Interest moderate to low.  6 Swash', '2003-02-11 19:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
