(213837, 12123, 1005, '<td valign="top">Golf nut!  Very colorful image.  Glare is a tad bright on the whiter balls, but overall this is a well done shot.  (Gotten any complaints about your yellow border?)  Good focus, framing works.  Challenge well met.  8 Swash</td>', 'Golf nut!  Very colorful image.  Glare is a tad bright on the whiter balls, but overall this is a well done shot.  (Gotten any complaints about your yellow border?)  Good focus, framing works.  Challenge well met.  8 Swash', '2003-02-11 19:16:35.000000', NULL, 1),
