(213999, 12075, 6328, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured an excellent photograph here.  The brass colors show up magnificently and the lighting coming in from the window and from above is great.  I''m not sure if I see you alone, of if there''s a girl beside you?  Are you the one in red?</td>', 'You''ve captured an excellent photograph here.  The brass colors show up magnificently and the lighting coming in from the window and from above is great.  I''m not sure if I see you alone, of if there''s a girl beside you?  Are you the one in red?', '2003-02-11 22:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(214001, 12150, 6328, '<td valign="top">Lovely snow scene.  I almost called this a Black and White until I looked closer and saw the color in it, especially in your coat.  You''ve done an excellent job.  Just out of curiousity, what is that to the right of you, in the snow, the dark object? Looked like it may have been a dog laying in the snow.</td>', 'Lovely snow scene.  I almost called this a Black and White until I looked closer and saw the color in it, especially in your coat.  You''ve done an excellent job.  Just out of curiousity, what is that to the right of you, in the snow, the dark object? Looked like it may have been a dog laying in the snow.', '2003-02-11 22:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(214002, 12107, 6328, '<td valign="top">Wow, beautiful colors, Waldo.</td>', 'Wow, beautiful colors, Waldo.', '2003-02-11 22:28:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(214003, 12255, 1647, '<td valign="top">Well it didn''t take long to find the "hidden" person, but other than that it''s a nice photo.  The leaves of the trees have a great texture to them.  Composition is also very good.  I really like the shades and textures though - there is so much to look at.  Good work - except for the "hide" aspect.</td>', 'Well it didn''t take long to find the "hidden" person, but other than that it''s a nice photo.  The leaves of the trees have a great texture to them.  Composition is also very good.  I really like the shades and textures though - there is so much to look at.  Good work - except for the "hide" aspect.', '2003-02-11 22:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(214004, 12142, 543, '<td valign="top">Stunning.  I assume you didn''t paint him, so I guess this effect is mostly achieved via levels.  Can''t wait for the ''How I did it''.  Congratulations!</td>', 'Stunning.  I assume you didn''t paint him, so I guess this effect is mostly achieved via levels.  Can''t wait for the ''How I did it''.  Congratulations!', '2003-02-11 22:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(214005, 12167, 6328, '<td valign="top">Beautiful Black &amp; White Photograph.  Has an excellent mood to it.  The eyes focus on that large tree to the left, take me all the way up the path to the light at the top and follow the tree''s all the way back down until I spotted you.  Excellent shot.</td>', 'Beautiful Black & White Photograph.  Has an excellent mood to it.  The eyes focus on that large tree to the left, take me all the way up the path to the light at the top and follow the tree''s all the way back down until I spotted you.  Excellent shot.', '2003-02-11 22:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(214006, 12309, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice work - The photo has lots of colour which would be good for a Where''s Waldo book.  I like the composition, although it looks like you took the shot slightly off-centre.  This is obvious looking at the top and bottom edges of the cupboard - they aren''t square to the photo.  Colour is great and lighting is pretty good, although perhaps a little too one-sided.</td>', 'Nice work - The photo has lots of colour which would be good for a Where''s Waldo book.  I like the composition, although it looks like you took the shot slightly off-centre.  This is obvious looking at the top and bottom edges of the cupboard - they aren''t square to the photo.  Colour is great and lighting is pretty good, although perhaps a little too one-sided.', '2003-02-11 22:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(214007, 12077, 6328, '<td valign="top">Gotcha in the doorway on the field!    Nice shot though!  Lots of color, nice clear shot for focusing through the fence.</td>', 'Gotcha in the doorway on the field!    Nice shot though!  Lots of color, nice clear shot for focusing through the fence.', '2003-02-11 22:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(214008, 12099, 1647, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately the person isn''t hidden, so much as cropped heavily.  Unfortunaltely the photo is a bit grainy, perhaps from low light, and isn''t terribly interesting to look at.</td>', 'Unfortunately the person isn''t hidden, so much as cropped heavily.  Unfortunaltely the photo is a bit grainy, perhaps from low light, and isn''t terribly interesting to look at.', '2003-02-11 22:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(214009, 12226, 1647, '<td valign="top">I think Waldo needs to practice his hiding...  It didn''t take long to find him.  Exposure and lighting for the photo are pretty good.  It looks like you''ve used a sheet of plastic to hide the original background, which is probably a good idea but I then would have used snow to hide the bottom of the sheet.  Composition is good, with a nice amount of space at each side.</td>', 'I think Waldo needs to practice his hiding...  It didn''t take long to find him.  Exposure and lighting for the photo are pretty good.  It looks like you''ve used a sheet of plastic to hide the original background, which is probably a good idea but I then would have used snow to hide the bottom of the sheet.  Composition is good, with a nice amount of space at each side.', '2003-02-11 22:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(214010, 12075, 1647, '<td valign="top">It my guess is correct the photographer is wearing black or blue and standing beside the person in red.  It''s a nice photo but I think it might be cropped too tightly.  You can''t see enough of the bench and two of the vats are partially cropped.</td>', 'It my guess is correct the photographer is wearing black or blue and standing beside the person in red.  It''s a nice photo but I think it might be cropped too tightly.  You can''t see enough of the bench and two of the vats are partially cropped.', '2003-02-11 22:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
