(214364, 12186, 1005, '<td valign="top">Ehhh, I think you missed the point of the challenge.  Is your finger the waldo?  I don''t think so.  The maze ends and waldo isn''t in the maze.....Good color and focus, well taken shot.  Challenge aspect  -  no, not really met.  7 Swash</td>', 'Ehhh, I think you missed the point of the challenge.  Is your finger the waldo?  I don''t think so.  The maze ends and waldo isn''t in the maze.....Good color and focus, well taken shot.  Challenge aspect  -  no, not really met.  7 Swash', '2003-02-12 16:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(214365, 12208, 1005, '<td valign="top">I know I''ve commented this shot, but it didn''t seem to "take".  I see you in the gazing globe.  It''s a busy shot, but then again, waldo type shots should be busy.  I really like the reflected sky, very nice.  7 Swash</td>', 'I know I''ve commented this shot, but it didn''t seem to "take".  I see you in the gazing globe.  It''s a busy shot, but then again, waldo type shots should be busy.  I really like the reflected sky, very nice.  7 Swash', '2003-02-12 16:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
