(214369, 12294, 1005, '<td valign="top">Is the finger puppet the waldo?  Appropriately busy, but it''s hard to tell which is supposed to be the waldo image.  A little glarish in places (king''s head, behind the toys, etc.).  Focus seems to be on the middle/far pieces, so the front items are out of focus.  Color is good.  Framing is O.K.  7 Swash</td>', 'Is the finger puppet the waldo?  Appropriately busy, but it''s hard to tell which is supposed to be the waldo image.  A little glarish in places (king''s head, behind the toys, etc.).  Focus seems to be on the middle/far pieces, so the front items are out of focus.  Color is good.  Framing is O.K.  7 Swash', '2003-02-12 16:16:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(214372, 12215, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cute!  Solid focus and bright color (but the white seems a little overly bright, esp in the upper middle of frame).  Framing works.  Challenge met, I see your waldo.  A tad bit of glare on the windows.  Nice trick.  7 Swash</td>', 'Cute!  Solid focus and bright color (but the white seems a little overly bright, esp in the upper middle of frame).  Framing works.  Challenge met, I see your waldo.  A tad bit of glare on the windows.  Nice trick.  7 Swash', '2003-02-12 16:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(214379, 12135, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very cute and very colorful!  I see your waldo.  Focus is pretty good, but some kernels are more distinct than others.  Lighting is good.  Overall, I like it!  9 Swash<br/>(DId you "pop" waldo?)</td>', 'Very cute and very colorful!  I see your waldo.  Focus is pretty good, but some kernels are more distinct than others.  Lighting is good.  Overall, I like it!  9 Swash(DId you "pop" waldo?)', '2003-02-12 16:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(214380, 12067, 1005, '<td valign="top">O.K. I see your waldo.  The combination of the lighting and (I think) the black and white doesn''t work well here.  There seems to be quite a bit of light grain over most of the image.  The window''s light is fairly blown out.  Focus is O.K., but hard to tell through the grain.  5 Swash</td>', 'O.K. I see your waldo.  The combination of the lighting and (I think) the black and white doesn''t work well here.  There seems to be quite a bit of light grain over most of the image.  The window''s light is fairly blown out.  Focus is O.K., but hard to tell through the grain.  5 Swash', '2003-02-12 16:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(214382, 12273, 1005, '<td valign="top">O.K. my old eyes aren''t THAT good, but I''ll just take your word that there is a person in one of those windows.  Framing is O.K, but I think you might want to crop the right edge a smidge, to remove the street light on yellow.  The sky is blown out, but I''m assuming it was partly cloudy and you couldn''t do much with that (the sun shining on the building makes me question my last comment.)  Focus is O.K., but due to the distances, the straight lines of the building come out a little jagged (esp. the white trim).  6 Swash</td>', 'O.K. my old eyes aren''t THAT good, but I''ll just take your word that there is a person in one of those windows.  Framing is O.K, but I think you might want to crop the right edge a smidge, to remove the street light on yellow.  The sky is blown out, but I''m assuming it was partly cloudy and you couldn''t do much with that (the sun shining on the building makes me question my last comment.)  Focus is O.K., but due to the distances, the straight lines of the building come out a little jagged (esp. the white trim).  6 Swash', '2003-02-12 16:29:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(214383, 12110, 1005, '<td valign="top">The silhouetted waldo was a bit hard to find, but it''s there.  The sunset isn''t very dramatic, but the tree silhouettes are nice.  7 Swash</td>', 'The silhouetted waldo was a bit hard to find, but it''s there.  The sunset isn''t very dramatic, but the tree silhouettes are nice.  7 Swash', '2003-02-12 16:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(214384, 12262, 1005, '<td valign="top">Turned the frame upside down?  The focus is pretty good, color seems a little diminished (try saturating more, digi-cams seem to drain color out of a photo).  All in all, it works pretty good.  8 Swash</td>', 'Turned the frame upside down?  The focus is pretty good, color seems a little diminished (try saturating more, digi-cams seem to drain color out of a photo).  All in all, it works pretty good.  8 Swash', '2003-02-12 16:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
