(214387, 12137, 1005, '<td valign="top">I see the leg.....It''s an O.K. photo, but I can''t really say the focus is good/bad or other (the plants seem less than distinct).  The color seems a little diminished, try upping the saturation a little (digi-cams drain color, but a little saturation goes a long way).  I keep thinking this needs something more....maybe a face peeking around the bush?  5 Swash</td>', 'I see the leg.....It''s an O.K. photo, but I can''t really say the focus is good/bad or other (the plants seem less than distinct).  The color seems a little diminished, try upping the saturation a little (digi-cams drain color, but a little saturation goes a long way).  I keep thinking this needs something more....maybe a face peeking around the bush?  5 Swash', '2003-02-12 16:38:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(214388, 12138, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very cute photo!  Good contrasts and very sharp focus.  Busy, but then a waldo shot should be!  (This was a popular idea {great minds think alike}, but this might be the best of this type, at least it''s my favorite).  9 Swash</td>', 'Very cute photo!  Good contrasts and very sharp focus.  Busy, but then a waldo shot should be!  (This was a popular idea {great minds think alike}, but this might be the best of this type, at least it''s my favorite).  9 Swash', '2003-02-12 16:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
