(214392, 12066, 1005, '<td valign="top">Waldo found.  Nice photo, is that strictly a walking bridge (no cars)?  I like the amount of foreground branches (not too much, not too little).  Color seems a little subdued, but it''s a cloudy day, right?  7 Swash</td>', 'Waldo found.  Nice photo, is that strictly a walking bridge (no cars)?  I like the amount of foreground branches (not too much, not too little).  Color seems a little subdued, but it''s a cloudy day, right?  7 Swash', '2003-02-12 16:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
