(214395, 12217, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very cute idea!  (I think I would have preferred this in living color, but that''s me)  Screen image looks best where it is shaded by the man''s head, a tad washed out with directly light.  Focus seems very good.  Framing works, but I would have been tempted to crop off the right edge closer to the monitor.  8 Swash</td>', 'Very cute idea!  (I think I would have preferred this in living color, but that''s me)  Screen image looks best where it is shaded by the man''s head, a tad washed out with directly light.  Focus seems very good.  Framing works, but I would have been tempted to crop off the right edge closer to the monitor.  8 Swash', '2003-02-12 16:57:36.000000', NULL, 1),
