(214652, 12153, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good idea with the reflection, although I would have not centered it so much. Maybe put it in one of the side windows so as to hide it more. The composition is otherwise great and the challenge has been met. Good job!</td>', 'Good idea with the reflection, although I would have not centered it so much. Maybe put it in one of the side windows so as to hide it more. The composition is otherwise great and the challenge has been met. Good job!', '2003-02-13 03:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(214655, 12198, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good composition here and the challenge has been met. Waldo was easy to find :-) Something about the sky strikes me as being a little greenish, did you enhance the green in the post-processing? I like this photo good job.</td>', 'Good composition here and the challenge has been met. Waldo was easy to find :-) Something about the sky strikes me as being a little greenish, did you enhance the green in the post-processing? I like this photo good job.', '2003-02-13 04:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
