(214669, 12157, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. This is broken into 5 levels. First sand at the bottom and then a level of stones, then wet sand, ocean and finally sky. I like it, good job! By the way are you standing in the water taking this shot?</td>', 'Nice shot. This is broken into 5 levels. First sand at the bottom and then a level of stones, then wet sand, ocean and finally sky. I like it, good job! By the way are you standing in the water taking this shot?', '2003-02-13 07:08:14.000000', NULL, 1),
