(214671, 12124, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wow she sure had fun modelling for this shot... Good one! Maybe the hand should have been hidden so that just the face is showing, in a way the hand is distracting. But all in all a great shot.</td>', 'Wow she sure had fun modelling for this shot... Good one! Maybe the hand should have been hidden so that just the face is showing, in a way the hand is distracting. But all in all a great shot.', '2003-02-13 07:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
