(214680, 12094, 4482, '<td valign="top">Very original concept on the Waldo theme. I think it really does meet the challenge in a metaphoric kinda way. :-)  I''m not sure about the light shining from the bottom though. The bars reflecting on the cans is a bit distracting. 8</td>', 'Very original concept on the Waldo theme. I think it really does meet the challenge in a metaphoric kinda way. :-)  I''m not sure about the light shining from the bottom though. The bars reflecting on the cans is a bit distracting. 8', '2003-02-13 08:26:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(214681, 12079, 4482, '<td valign="top">Very original. Meets the challenge without a doubt! good use of the rule of 3rds. It just lacks a bit of the WOW factor.  :-)  8</td>', 'Very original. Meets the challenge without a doubt! good use of the rule of 3rds. It just lacks a bit of the WOW factor.  :-)  8', '2003-02-13 08:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(214682, 12175, 4482, '<td valign="top">Great angle on this shot! WOuld have been good for the perspective challenge also!  Very original. On of my tops. The white balance doesn''t seem to be spot on, just a td distracting. 8</td>', 'Great angle on this shot! WOuld have been good for the perspective challenge also!  Very original. On of my tops. The white balance doesn''t seem to be spot on, just a td distracting. 8', '2003-02-13 08:29:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(214684, 12100, 6284, '<td valign="top">This would be an absolute wonderful photo if it weren''t so dark.  Since I don''t know what kind of camera you are using I would guess it is a point and shoot camera.  Try using either paintshop or photoshop to brighten it up some.  She is a cutie =o)</td>', 'This would be an absolute wonderful photo if it weren''t so dark.  Since I don''t know what kind of camera you are using I would guess it is a point and shoot camera.  Try using either paintshop or photoshop to brighten it up some.  She is a cutie =o)', '2003-02-13 08:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(214707, 12091, 4162, '<td valign="top">Thats really funny! Had a good laugh when I realised....</td>', 'Thats really funny! Had a good laugh when I realised....', '2003-02-13 09:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(214712, 12170, 5728, '<td valign="top">There weren''t really too many places you could hide Waldo in this photo! It''s good, nice idea, great shot. What''s that just to the left of Waldo? Is that someone''s head?</td>', 'There weren''t really too many places you could hide Waldo in this photo! It''s good, nice idea, great shot. What''s that just to the left of Waldo? Is that someone''s head?', '2003-02-13 10:03:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(214714, 12110, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good one, merging Waldo into the shadows, it almost seems he is part of the tree, only the roundness of his head gives him away. Choice!</td>', 'Good one, merging Waldo into the shadows, it almost seems he is part of the tree, only the roundness of his head gives him away. Choice!', '2003-02-13 10:04:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(214715, 12135, 5728, '<td valign="top">Is this what Waldo really looks like? I didn''t know that! It''s original and meets the challenge. I think it could be a little bit more in focus though. I like it. You didn''t paint all that pop corn yourself did you?</td>', 'Is this what Waldo really looks like? I didn''t know that! It''s original and meets the challenge. I think it could be a little bit more in focus though. I like it. You didn''t paint all that pop corn yourself did you?', '2003-02-13 10:09:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(214716, 12096, 5728, '<td valign="top">Well hidden in the reflection and yes it does  appear kind of ghostly! The photo seems a little grainy to me, where was your main focal point in this one?</td>', 'Well hidden in the reflection and yes it does  appear kind of ghostly! The photo seems a little grainy to me, where was your main focal point in this one?', '2003-02-13 10:14:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(214722, 12054, 5999, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, great detail. Focus a little soft around the mouth. Challenge?</td>', 'Nice lighting, great detail. Focus a little soft around the mouth. Challenge?', '2003-02-13 10:33:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(214724, 12281, 4210, '<td valign="top">I love the creamy background.</td>', 'I love the creamy background.', '2003-02-13 10:41:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(214727, 12094, 5999, '<td valign="top">Love this one! Very Warholian. Crisp and clean. Kinda distracted by the grill at the bottom, but the barred shadows on the cans add something. Couldn''t quite stretch the challenge definition to fit though.</td>', 'Love this one! Very Warholian. Crisp and clean. Kinda distracted by the grill at the bottom, but the barred shadows on the cans add something. Couldn''t quite stretch the challenge definition to fit though.', '2003-02-13 10:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(214751, 12068, 1005, '<td valign="top">I give up, where''s waldo?  (Teasing me w/o a waldo isn''t fair!)  {Please PM me if there is a waldo in this shot with the location and this photo''s name  -2 points will be added back with an accepted Waldo location} Very good focus and color, framing works.  6 Swash<br/>I see the yellow hut, but gosh, my old eyes still don''t see anybody.  I will have to  take your word for it, freebie.  8 Swash</td>', 'I give up, where''s waldo?  (Teasing me w/o a waldo isn''t fair!)  {Please PM me if there is a waldo in this shot with the location and this photo''s name  -2 points will be added back with an accepted Waldo location} Very good focus and color, framing works.  6 SwashI see the yellow hut, but gosh, my old eyes still don''t see anybody.  I will have to  take your word for it, freebie.  8 Swash', '2003-02-13 12:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(214754, 12171, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very pretty picture.  Good focus/framing and color.  I don''t see your "waldo", maybe tracks, but not the fella, I need to see the fella.  (If I am missing something here, please PM me with Waldo''s location and the picture name, I will adjust these comments and my score).  6 Swash<br/>O.K. I''m afraid I still don''t see him/them, I do think I see a blue dot next to the larger tree in the far background, but I can''t make it out as a person.  (Please excuse my tired old eyes!)  I will take your word for it.  8 Swash</td>', 'Very pretty picture.  Good focus/framing and color.  I don''t see your "waldo", maybe tracks, but not the fella, I need to see the fella.  (If I am missing something here, please PM me with Waldo''s location and the picture name, I will adjust these comments and my score).  6 SwashO.K. I''m afraid I still don''t see him/them, I do think I see a blue dot next to the larger tree in the far background, but I can''t make it out as a person.  (Please excuse my tired old eyes!)  I will take your word for it.  8 Swash', '2003-02-13 12:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
