(215023, 12186, 4648, '<td valign="top">I followed the maze but never found Waldo.  And I really thought the challenge was to be able to find Waldo, an actual person, in whatever the photo was.  A finger is the closest thing to a person I found.  SO...to me you have not met the challenge, even though you do have a colorful, nicely focused unique composition.  Because you didn''t meet the challenge I can''t give it more than a 5.</td>', 'I followed the maze but never found Waldo.  And I really thought the challenge was to be able to find Waldo, an actual person, in whatever the photo was.  A finger is the closest thing to a person I found.  SO...to me you have not met the challenge, even though you do have a colorful, nicely focused unique composition.  Because you didn''t meet the challenge I can''t give it more than a 5.', '2003-02-13 21:43:51.000000', NULL, 1),
