(215025, 12258, 4648, '<td valign="top">Well hidden face, even though I don''t personally care for the painting.  It''s not my type of art work.  Nice way you made 3 possible places for the face.  Well done.</td>', 'Well hidden face, even though I don''t personally care for the painting.  It''s not my type of art work.  Nice way you made 3 possible places for the face.  Well done.', '2003-02-13 21:46:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(215026, 12093, 4648, '<td valign="top">Took me a long time to spot Waldo standing on the bridge.  Good job of hiding him.  And this is a beautiful photo.  I like the sepia type tone and think it served you well to hid him, but I would love to see it in color.  It is an awesome photo.  Well done.</td>', 'Took me a long time to spot Waldo standing on the bridge.  Good job of hiding him.  And this is a beautiful photo.  I like the sepia type tone and think it served you well to hid him, but I would love to see it in color.  It is an awesome photo.  Well done.', '2003-02-13 21:48:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(215027, 12222, 4648, '<td valign="top">Photo appears to e over sharpened.    I don''t understand the dirty grey color to the snow, if it is for a reason.  Right now can not spot Waldo and will have to come back to see if I can.  For the photo in itself, it is not well done, very crowded with footprints, etc.  As I said, over sharpened, out of focus, grainy and overall not real clear.</td>', 'Photo appears to e over sharpened.    I don''t understand the dirty grey color to the snow, if it is for a reason.  Right now can not spot Waldo and will have to come back to see if I can.  For the photo in itself, it is not well done, very crowded with footprints, etc.  As I said, over sharpened, out of focus, grainy and overall not real clear.', '2003-02-13 21:52:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(215028, 12194, 4648, '<td valign="top">Courious as to what this is a photo of.  Nice clean clear focus,  Good job of hiding Waldo at the round thing.  I hate it that I don''t know what this isl  It''s frustrating.  But it is a very well done beautiful photo.</td>', 'Courious as to what this is a photo of.  Nice clean clear focus,  Good job of hiding Waldo at the round thing.  I hate it that I don''t know what this isl  It''s frustrating.  But it is a very well done beautiful photo.', '2003-02-13 21:55:10.000000', NULL, 1),
