(215048, 12181, 6100, '<td valign="top">Nice shot whether there''s a Waldo or not. Actually, the shot is too good to be sticking a "Waldo" in it.</td>', 'Nice shot whether there''s a Waldo or not. Actually, the shot is too good to be sticking a "Waldo" in it.', '2003-02-13 22:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
