(215072, 12196, 4648, '<td valign="top">Photo a little too dark to really tell much of anything.  I see something, maybe, on the door but not really.  Really needs to be lightened.  If I find Waldo I''ll up the score by 2.</td>', 'Photo a little too dark to really tell much of anything.  I see something, maybe, on the door but not really.  Really needs to be lightened.  If I find Waldo I''ll up the score by 2.', '2003-02-13 22:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
