(215076, 12092, 4648, '<td valign="top">Nice photo of a cute kid.  Just doesn''t meet the challenge of "Hiding Waldo".  So can''t give more than a score of 5.  And that''s a shame because the photo is really a great photo.  Nicely focused, good color, well executed.  Just doesn''t meet the challenge.</td>', 'Nice photo of a cute kid.  Just doesn''t meet the challenge of "Hiding Waldo".  So can''t give more than a score of 5.  And that''s a shame because the photo is really a great photo.  Nicely focused, good color, well executed.  Just doesn''t meet the challenge.', '2003-02-13 22:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
