(215083, 12079, 4648, '<td valign="top">Nice eyes.  Way to hide Waldo.  Good focus.  Not an easy one to photograph in my opinion and you did a great job.  Well done.</td>', 'Nice eyes.  Way to hide Waldo.  Good focus.  Not an easy one to photograph in my opinion and you did a great job.  Well done.', '2003-02-13 23:10:43.000000', NULL, 1),
