(215118, 12261, 4648, '<td valign="top">Won''t get it in my book.   I know you havae more imagination than this.  You did a better job of hiding the bottle than yourself.  Good sharp photo, if it was only what they were asking for.  Now, go out and get that shot.</td>', 'Won''t get it in my book.   I know you havae more imagination than this.  You did a better job of hiding the bottle than yourself.  Good sharp photo, if it was only what they were asking for.  Now, go out and get that shot.', '2003-02-14 00:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
