(215131, 12142, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very awesome shot. Nice use of camouflage to hide your person. I like it.</td>', 'Very awesome shot. Nice use of camouflage to hide your person. I like it.', '2003-02-14 00:28:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(215132, 12163, 3419, '<td valign="top">If you''d made the eye look like it was on the spine of a book, your person would be "more" hidden. Nice abstract shot.</td>', 'If you''d made the eye look like it was on the spine of a book, your person would be "more" hidden. Nice abstract shot.', '2003-02-14 00:30:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(215133, 12155, 4648, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I understand this photo.  I''m not even sure what it is.  It is colorful.  What is the dark spot in the sky on the left side.  Is it a bird?  Hope you explain this photo.  I feel the feet of the giraffe need to be in focus.  But this is just me.</td>', 'I''m not sure I understand this photo.  I''m not even sure what it is.  It is colorful.  What is the dark spot in the sky on the left side.  Is it a bird?  Hope you explain this photo.  I feel the feet of the giraffe need to be in focus.  But this is just me.', '2003-02-14 00:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(215135, 12127, 3419, '<td valign="top">Yes I can - lower right third. Nicely hidden! There''s a couple of pieces that are reflecting light that are very distracting. I kept wondering if your person was on one of those.</td>', 'Yes I can - lower right third. Nicely hidden! There''s a couple of pieces that are reflecting light that are very distracting. I kept wondering if your person was on one of those.', '2003-02-14 00:32:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(215136, 12181, 6049, '<td valign="top">great photo! i love the colors and the palms. meets the challenge. i found eddie too (lower left corner). good luck to this challenge</td>', 'great photo! i love the colors and the palms. meets the challenge. i found eddie too (lower left corner). good luck to this challenge', '2003-02-14 00:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(215137, 12256, 4648, '<td valign="top">Where and what is this a photo of?  It is beautiful.  So clean and clearly focused.  Nice composition and well executed.  Postcard shot.  BUT personally I don''t see it as a "hiding Waldo" photo.  I see several people but don''t see anyone especially hidden.  I like it as a photo on it''s own.  Great photo, really great, but I don''t really think it meets the challenge.  But it''s one I''d like to have as a postcard.</td>', 'Where and what is this a photo of?  It is beautiful.  So clean and clearly focused.  Nice composition and well executed.  Postcard shot.  BUT personally I don''t see it as a "hiding Waldo" photo.  I see several people but don''t see anyone especially hidden.  I like it as a photo on it''s own.  Great photo, really great, but I don''t really think it meets the challenge.  But it''s one I''d like to have as a postcard.', '2003-02-14 00:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(215138, 12269, 6049, '<td valign="top">could be better if the whole truck is seen</td>', 'could be better if the whole truck is seen', '2003-02-14 00:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(215139, 12160, 4648, '<td valign="top">Please don''t take this wrong, but with your title this appears to be a prison or a physichiatric hospital.  I don''t see it as a photo hiding Waldo in among the "stuff".  Maybe that''s Waldo on the right side in the dark, but personally I don''t feel that is what was meant by the challenge.  Therefore, in my opinion, it doesn''t meet the challenge.  But that''s just me.  It is a clear clean sharp photo.  A little too much of the interior wasted space for my preference.</td>', 'Please don''t take this wrong, but with your title this appears to be a prison or a physichiatric hospital.  I don''t see it as a photo hiding Waldo in among the "stuff".  Maybe that''s Waldo on the right side in the dark, but personally I don''t feel that is what was meant by the challenge.  Therefore, in my opinion, it doesn''t meet the challenge.  But that''s just me.  It is a clear clean sharp photo.  A little too much of the interior wasted space for my preference.', '2003-02-14 00:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(215141, 12297, 4648, '<td valign="top">My comment:  unique, different, strange, I like it.  I especailly like the angle of the shot.  Good decision.  Looks like Waldo broke a couple of limbs climbing up to hide in the trees.  In fact he did such a good job of hiding that I can''t even find him.  When I do, to make sure he''s there, your score goes up by 2 points.  Good job.  Nice photo.</td>', 'My comment:  unique, different, strange, I like it.  I especailly like the angle of the shot.  Good decision.  Looks like Waldo broke a couple of limbs climbing up to hide in the trees.  In fact he did such a good job of hiding that I can''t even find him.  When I do, to make sure he''s there, your score goes up by 2 points.  Good job.  Nice photo.', '2003-02-14 00:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(215142, 12168, 4648, '<td valign="top">I feel your title is a hint, but I still can''t find Waldo.  I''ll keep looking.  It would help if the focus were better.</td>', 'I feel your title is a hint, but I still can''t find Waldo.  I''ll keep looking.  It would help if the focus were better.', '2003-02-14 00:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(215143, 12217, 4648, '<td valign="top">Not fair.  Too easy to spot him.  Hope you explain how you did this..  For those from the other countries who didn''t understand what was meant by this challenge will understand if they just look at this photo.  Nice but shoudl have been in  color.  Really needed to be in color.  Did I mention I would have liked it in color?  Nice shot.</td>', 'Not fair.  Too easy to spot him.  Hope you explain how you did this..  For those from the other countries who didn''t understand what was meant by this challenge will understand if they just look at this photo.  Nice but shoudl have been in  color.  Really needed to be in color.  Did I mention I would have liked it in color?  Nice shot.', '2003-02-14 00:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(215144, 12226, 4648, '<td valign="top">REally cute photo.  just doesn''t appeal to me for the challenge.  Yes, it really is good and I realize a lot was put into this.  I just personally don''t believe this was what was meant for this challenge.  But I do like the photo.</td>', 'REally cute photo.  just doesn''t appeal to me for the challenge.  Yes, it really is good and I realize a lot was put into this.  I just personally don''t believe this was what was meant for this challenge.  But I do like the photo.', '2003-02-14 00:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(215145, 12233, 4648, '<td valign="top">Never thought about using the video feature of the camera this way.  Way to do.  Good job.  This had to be very hard to accomplish though, even with that feature.  I can''t get it this clear.  Great job.  Well done.</td>', 'Never thought about using the video feature of the camera this way.  Way to do.  Good job.  This had to be very hard to accomplish though, even with that feature.  I can''t get it this clear.  Great job.  Well done.', '2003-02-14 00:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(215147, 12107, 6049, '<td valign="top">great colors!!!! and a very good photo. nice score too</td>', 'great colors!!!! and a very good photo. nice score too', '2003-02-14 00:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(215148, 12172, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.  Is Waldo the flying nun in the tree that made the foot prints to the tree.  That''s the only Waldo I''ve spotted so far.  I''ve been too busy admiring the beautiful photo.  Did you notice how the tree limbs made an oval frame for Waldo? Or was that coincidential?  I''ll feel like a fool if that''s not Waldo.  This is really a beautiful photo, well done. beautifully focused and nicely cropped.  Great job.  My only 9, which is my highest score yet.</td>', 'Beautiful photo.  Is Waldo the flying nun in the tree that made the foot prints to the tree.  That''s the only Waldo I''ve spotted so far.  I''ve been too busy admiring the beautiful photo.  Did you notice how the tree limbs made an oval frame for Waldo? Or was that coincidential?  I''ll feel like a fool if that''s not Waldo.  This is really a beautiful photo, well done. beautifully focused and nicely cropped.  Great job.  My only 9, which is my highest score yet.', '2003-02-14 01:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(215149, 12294, 4648, '<td valign="top">If the wooden sholdier had not pointed Waldo out I might never have found him.  thanks.  Biggest complaint is the yellow tint to the photo.  It is a really nice photo, but the yellow tint ruins it.  Should have adjusted the colors and gotten rid of that, cause it really ruined a great photo, and a great challenge photo.</td>', 'If the wooden sholdier had not pointed Waldo out I might never have found him.  thanks.  Biggest complaint is the yellow tint to the photo.  It is a really nice photo, but the yellow tint ruins it.  Should have adjusted the colors and gotten rid of that, cause it really ruined a great photo, and a great challenge photo.', '2003-02-14 01:04:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(215151, 12217, 6049, '<td valign="top">i think this will look better in colored</td>', 'i think this will look better in colored', '2003-02-14 01:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(215152, 12140, 5212, '<td valign="top">Great shot, love the lighting.  Very original and meets the challenge well. 9</td>', 'Great shot, love the lighting.  Very original and meets the challenge well. 9', '2003-02-14 01:17:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(215153, 12123, 5212, '<td valign="top">Good idea, don''t care for the wide bright framing, however.</td>', 'Good idea, don''t care for the wide bright framing, however.', '2003-02-14 01:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(215154, 12171, 5212, '<td valign="top">Good way to meet the challenge, like the hint in the title.</td>', 'Good way to meet the challenge, like the hint in the title.', '2003-02-14 01:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(215156, 12100, 5212, '<td valign="top">You might try this with a vertical crop and the tags off the bear.  Cute picture, though.</td>', 'You might try this with a vertical crop and the tags off the bear.  Cute picture, though.', '2003-02-14 01:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(215157, 12170, 5212, '<td valign="top">Nice image and challenge met well.</td>', 'Nice image and challenge met well.', '2003-02-14 01:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(215158, 12187, 5212, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, didn''t find waldo, though!</td>', 'Interesting photo, didn''t find waldo, though!', '2003-02-14 01:24:12.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(215159, 12258, 5212, '<td valign="top">Cute use of the challenge, might have liked it a bit better cropped tighter and the face filling in the hole a little more.</td>', 'Cute use of the challenge, might have liked it a bit better cropped tighter and the face filling in the hole a little more.', '2003-02-14 01:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(215160, 12124, 5212, '<td valign="top">Very cute!  I like how you rotated this to make "waldo" a little more "hidden"!</td>', 'Very cute!  I like how you rotated this to make "waldo" a little more "hidden"!', '2003-02-14 01:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(215161, 12068, 5212, '<td valign="top">Maybe this was an outtake for perspectives, if not it is a good example of that topic, too.  Interesting image.</td>', 'Maybe this was an outtake for perspectives, if not it is a good example of that topic, too.  Interesting image.', '2003-02-14 01:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(215162, 12221, 5212, '<td valign="top">A little unevenly lit.  And I might have taken away or cropped out the stuff in the upper left corner.  Waldo must be the one with the big feet!</td>', 'A little unevenly lit.  And I might have taken away or cropped out the stuff in the upper left corner.  Waldo must be the one with the big feet!', '2003-02-14 01:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(215163, 12135, 5212, '<td valign="top">Well, the colors are glorious.  Good use of the challenge.</td>', 'Well, the colors are glorious.  Good use of the challenge.', '2003-02-14 01:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(215164, 12283, 5212, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see this a little lighter and the lighting a little softer.  Cute photo.</td>', 'I''d like to see this a little lighter and the lighting a little softer.  Cute photo.', '2003-02-14 01:33:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(215165, 12071, 5212, '<td valign="top">Lovely portrait of this child.</td>', 'Lovely portrait of this child.', '2003-02-14 01:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(215167, 12211, 5212, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed shot.  that is some BROWN water!</td>', 'Nicely composed shot.  that is some BROWN water!', '2003-02-14 01:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(215168, 12083, 6087, '<td valign="top">very creative</td>', 'very creative', '2003-02-14 01:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(215169, 12148, 5212, '<td valign="top">How funny and creative!</td>', 'How funny and creative!', '2003-02-14 01:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(215170, 12224, 5212, '<td valign="top">Very nice, even like the framing.  8</td>', 'Very nice, even like the framing.  8', '2003-02-14 01:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
