(215176, 12099, 6049, '<td valign="top">a bit grainy</td>', 'a bit grainy', '2003-02-14 01:44:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(215177, 12075, 5212, '<td valign="top">A little chromatic abbheration (sp) in the upper right, along with a little overexposure there, although this was a tough shot with the lighting available.  I use my saturation tool and try to remove magenta by de-saturating that color, as my camera does the same thing.  Very creative use of the c hallenge.  Good luck.</td>', 'A little chromatic abbheration (sp) in the upper right, along with a little overexposure there, although this was a tough shot with the lighting available.  I use my saturation tool and try to remove magenta by de-saturating that color, as my camera does the same thing.  Very creative use of the c hallenge.  Good luck.', '2003-02-14 01:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(215178, 12154, 6087, '<td valign="top">cute</td>', 'cute', '2003-02-14 01:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(215182, 12110, 4494, '<td valign="top">No waldo.</td>', 'No waldo.', '2003-02-14 01:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(215183, 12229, 5212, '<td valign="top">No, I can''t see you!!  Looks like there was some moisture somewhere when you took this shot, or something else to cause those circles in this shot.</td>', 'No, I can''t see you!!  Looks like there was some moisture somewhere when you took this shot, or something else to cause those circles in this shot.', '2003-02-14 01:49:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(215185, 12142, 5212, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo, very creative use of the challenge, and your subject.  Will be anxious to see how you made this photo. 8</td>', 'Lovely photo, very creative use of the challenge, and your subject.  Will be anxious to see how you made this photo. 8', '2003-02-14 01:50:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(215186, 12297, 5212, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, might have wanted more dof, nice composition, can''t find waldo!</td>', 'Interesting photo, might have wanted more dof, nice composition, can''t find waldo!', '2003-02-14 01:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(215187, 12169, 5212, '<td valign="top">One of my more favored stuffed-toy waldo shots.  Waldo looks like he''s had hepatitis for a longggg time!  The lighting is a little strange in the upper corners.</td>', 'One of my more favored stuffed-toy waldo shots.  Waldo looks like he''s had hepatitis for a longggg time!  The lighting is a little strange in the upper corners.', '2003-02-14 01:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(215189, 12215, 5212, '<td valign="top">Great use of legos and meets the challenge well.  Really like the lighting, might have preferred the top cropped off a bit so that the lego nubs were not exposed up there.  Good luck in the challenge!</td>', 'Great use of legos and meets the challenge well.  Really like the lighting, might have preferred the top cropped off a bit so that the lego nubs were not exposed up there.  Good luck in the challenge!', '2003-02-14 01:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(215190, 12133, 5212, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, clear focus, nice colors and good job meeting the challenge.  I think this will be in the top group, 10</td>', 'Good lighting, clear focus, nice colors and good job meeting the challenge.  I think this will be in the top group, 10', '2003-02-14 01:58:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(215191, 12063, 5212, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure that I like the lighting in this shot, but it''s very original and creative!</td>', 'I''m not sure that I like the lighting in this shot, but it''s very original and creative!', '2003-02-14 02:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(215193, 12251, 5212, '<td valign="top">Ooh, that bridge looks a little tipsy!  The strong lighting seems to wash out some of the trees on the left, but looks nice in the foreground of the photo, imo.</td>', 'Ooh, that bridge looks a little tipsy!  The strong lighting seems to wash out some of the trees on the left, but looks nice in the foreground of the photo, imo.', '2003-02-14 02:02:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(215195, 12222, 5212, '<td valign="top">Neat idea, wish there was more of a focal point in this shot.  This was a tough challenge.</td>', 'Neat idea, wish there was more of a focal point in this shot.  This was a tough challenge.', '2003-02-14 02:02:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(215196, 12250, 5212, '<td valign="top">I love the way all the faces are turned up like your "waldo"  Wonderful expression on the child, very nice coloring in the photo.</td>', 'I love the way all the faces are turned up like your "waldo"  Wonderful expression on the child, very nice coloring in the photo.', '2003-02-14 02:04:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(215197, 12053, 5212, '<td valign="top">Very , very nice.  She almost looks manequin--like.  10</td>', 'Very , very nice.  She almost looks manequin--like.  10', '2003-02-14 02:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(215198, 12309, 5212, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the challenge topic.  Good colors and focus.</td>', 'Nice use of the challenge topic.  Good colors and focus.', '2003-02-14 02:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(215199, 12121, 5212, '<td valign="top">This would be a good perspective photo!</td>', 'This would be a good perspective photo!', '2003-02-14 02:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(215200, 12110, 5212, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and use of the challenge of this photo.  This was a tough challenge.</td>', 'I like the composition and use of the challenge of this photo.  This was a tough challenge.', '2003-02-14 02:11:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(215201, 12237, 5212, '<td valign="top">Get the rescue kittie message in at the same time as this creative photo.  Only thing I might change is the books in the background right.</td>', 'Get the rescue kittie message in at the same time as this creative photo.  Only thing I might change is the books in the background right.', '2003-02-14 02:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(215202, 12295, 5212, '<td valign="top">Very creative way to meet the challenge.</td>', 'Very creative way to meet the challenge.', '2003-02-14 02:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(215203, 12242, 5212, '<td valign="top">Might have used a little more dof in this shot.</td>', 'Might have used a little more dof in this shot.', '2003-02-14 02:15:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(215204, 12079, 5212, '<td valign="top">Very funny, good use of the challenge.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very funny, good use of the challenge.  Good luck.', '2003-02-14 02:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(215205, 12066, 5212, '<td valign="top">Great shot, love the framing with the branches, good use of dof, and meets the challenge very well.  9</td>', 'Great shot, love the framing with the branches, good use of dof, and meets the challenge very well.  9', '2003-02-14 02:18:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(215207, 12224, 6049, '<td valign="top">is the boy added by using PS? seems like.</td>', 'is the boy added by using PS? seems like.', '2003-02-14 02:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(215211, 12255, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful infrared photo, those leaves have come out great! Waldo wasn''t too difficult to find though, I found his hiding place immediately :-) You did well on this one!</td>', 'This is a wonderful infrared photo, those leaves have come out great! Waldo wasn''t too difficult to find though, I found his hiding place immediately :-) You did well on this one!', '2003-02-14 02:31:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(215212, 12234, 5728, '<td valign="top">Great shot, brrrr I feel the coldness there. Waldo is hidden well (with his dog of course). Challenge met and a good photo to go along.</td>', 'Great shot, brrrr I feel the coldness there. Waldo is hidden well (with his dog of course). Challenge met and a good photo to go along.', '2003-02-14 02:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(215217, 12276, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is an original shot. I would prefered to have the butterflies in focus and Waldo out of focus in the background adding to the hiding effect. Great idea though!</td>', 'This is an original shot. I would prefered to have the butterflies in focus and Waldo out of focus in the background adding to the hiding effect. Great idea though!', '2003-02-14 02:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(215226, 12237, 3419, '<td valign="top">Very cute - your eyes look like they actually belong on the cat. Very creative. The books at the right are distracting.</td>', 'Very cute - your eyes look like they actually belong on the cat. Very creative. The books at the right are distracting.', '2003-02-14 02:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(215228, 12229, 3419, '<td valign="top">No, I cannot, and I''ve turned my brightness way up to 100%, so I have to conclude that there is no person in this photo. I can almost see two pairs of ghostly eye looking at me through the tree branches, but there''s not enough detail for me to conclude that they belong to a person. This photo is very interesting to look at - kind of spooky.</td>', 'No, I cannot, and I''ve turned my brightness way up to 100%, so I have to conclude that there is no person in this photo. I can almost see two pairs of ghostly eye looking at me through the tree branches, but there''s not enough detail for me to conclude that they belong to a person. This photo is very interesting to look at - kind of spooky.', '2003-02-14 03:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(215229, 12079, 3419, '<td valign="top">Nice try, but not well enough hidden.</td>', 'Nice try, but not well enough hidden.', '2003-02-14 03:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(215238, 12262, 5728, '<td valign="top">Your camo needs a shave :-) Good idea this one I wish I had thought of something along the same lines! You sure met the challenge on this one.</td>', 'Your camo needs a shave :-) Good idea this one I wish I had thought of something along the same lines! You sure met the challenge on this one.', '2003-02-14 04:11:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(215240, 12283, 5728, '<td valign="top">I have never seen so many cuddly toys as I have in this challenge! Funny that you all had the same idea. I like this one, especially the monkeys hand on the right which seems as if it belongs to Waldo.</td>', 'I have never seen so many cuddly toys as I have in this challenge! Funny that you all had the same idea. I like this one, especially the monkeys hand on the right which seems as if it belongs to Waldo.', '2003-02-14 04:13:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(215242, 12212, 5728, '<td valign="top">Original idea. The composition is good, I like the angle you have on this photo. Waldo is hidden back there so you met the challenge. I can''t see where your main focal point is here, but I guess it is the first telephone right?</td>', 'Original idea. The composition is good, I like the angle you have on this photo. Waldo is hidden back there so you met the challenge. I can''t see where your main focal point is here, but I guess it is the first telephone right?', '2003-02-14 04:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(215244, 12187, 5728, '<td valign="top">At first I was trying to find Waldo in the reflection but he is in the window! Well hidden, therefore the challenge well met. That reflection is amazing. Good one.</td>', 'At first I was trying to find Waldo in the reflection but he is in the window! Well hidden, therefore the challenge well met. That reflection is amazing. Good one.', '2003-02-14 04:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(215245, 12091, 5728, '<td valign="top">Poor mummy all buried away under the blankets! Very original shot, although you cannot see Waldo in person you know he is there. Challenge met for sure.</td>', 'Poor mummy all buried away under the blankets! Very original shot, although you cannot see Waldo in person you know he is there. Challenge met for sure.', '2003-02-14 04:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(215246, 12232, 5728, '<td valign="top">Aha you had the same idea as me! This is a very nice capture and just enough shadow at the bottom to hide Waldo''s foot. Good job!</td>', 'Aha you had the same idea as me! This is a very nice capture and just enough shadow at the bottom to hide Waldo''s foot. Good job!', '2003-02-14 04:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(215247, 12180, 5728, '<td valign="top">Although Waldo is not really hidden all that well you have met the challenge. The focus is good, those apples sure look shiney. Did you polish them up first before taking the shot? I would have prefered to have used a different background for this one though, that gray carpet gives this photo a kind of bland feeling to it.</td>', 'Although Waldo is not really hidden all that well you have met the challenge. The focus is good, those apples sure look shiney. Did you polish them up first before taking the shot? I would have prefered to have used a different background for this one though, that gray carpet gives this photo a kind of bland feeling to it.', '2003-02-14 04:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(215248, 12298, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, certainly different to all the other photos I have seen. The sepia effect works well here. Good one.</td>', 'Nice idea, certainly different to all the other photos I have seen. The sepia effect works well here. Good one.', '2003-02-14 04:37:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(215249, 12155, 5728, '<td valign="top">That giraffe almost looks unreal! If it weren''t for the blur on its legs I would have guessed it is a toy or onament :-) Nice composition with Lady Waldo hiding (?) out the back there. Good one!</td>', 'That giraffe almost looks unreal! If it weren''t for the blur on its legs I would have guessed it is a toy or onament :-) Nice composition with Lady Waldo hiding (?) out the back there. Good one!', '2003-02-14 04:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(215251, 12085, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good shot, looks good in B/W. A bit dark in the lower left hand corner but I don''t think that is too negative for this photo. I like it.</td>', 'Good shot, looks good in B/W. A bit dark in the lower left hand corner but I don''t think that is too negative for this photo. I like it.', '2003-02-14 04:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(215253, 12168, 5728, '<td valign="top">Is that Waldo hiding in the background? I can''t make him out to clearly but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt, it looks like a kind of statue to me. Anyway nice greens here and the blurred effect in the background really helps to hide Waldo. Good job!</td>', 'Is that Waldo hiding in the background? I can''t make him out to clearly but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt, it looks like a kind of statue to me. Anyway nice greens here and the blurred effect in the background really helps to hide Waldo. Good job!', '2003-02-14 04:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(215255, 12256, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is a very crisp and sharp shot, good one. But which one is Waldo? One of the people standing on the right or is he hidden somewhere? There are so many hiding places so far away! Good luck.</td>', 'This is a very crisp and sharp shot, good one. But which one is Waldo? One of the people standing on the right or is he hidden somewhere? There are so many hiding places so far away! Good luck.', '2003-02-14 04:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(215256, 12093, 5728, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo especially in B/W. That''s one of those kinds of bridges I love, I always wondered why they have a roof on them, I still don''t know why! Waldo is there so you met the challenge, the composition is appealing. Good job there!</td>', 'Lovely photo especially in B/W. That''s one of those kinds of bridges I love, I always wondered why they have a roof on them, I still don''t know why! Waldo is there so you met the challenge, the composition is appealing. Good job there!', '2003-02-14 04:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(215258, 12186, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very original idea here. It''s deception right? Trying to show which way Waldo went, when all along the finger is Waldo.... good! You nearly fooled me there :-)</td>', 'Very original idea here. It''s deception right? Trying to show which way Waldo went, when all along the finger is Waldo.... good! You nearly fooled me there :-)', '2003-02-14 05:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(215274, 12090, 5728, '<td valign="top">Funny! This would have looked great a little later in the day when all you could see is the silouhettes!! I like it, good luck!</td>', 'Funny! This would have looked great a little later in the day when all you could see is the silouhettes!! I like it, good luck!', '2003-02-14 06:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(215275, 12082, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good! I like the footprints leading up to the front of the photo and the loooong shadow of Waldo. The composition is good, it appeals to me somehow. I am not too sure I would have left the car in the photo though, but that is a matter of taste.</td>', 'Good! I like the footprints leading up to the front of the photo and the loooong shadow of Waldo. The composition is good, it appeals to me somehow. I am not too sure I would have left the car in the photo though, but that is a matter of taste.', '2003-02-14 06:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(215277, 12269, 5728, '<td valign="top">Hey you took the photo before Waldo before he got to his hiding place :-)) No, it is a good photo, especially in B/W to bring in more shadow for Waldo to hide in, but I bet that sky is soooo blue right? Nice composition, good job.</td>', 'Hey you took the photo before Waldo before he got to his hiding place :-)) No, it is a good photo, especially in B/W to bring in more shadow for Waldo to hide in, but I bet that sky is soooo blue right? Nice composition, good job.', '2003-02-14 06:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(215279, 12097, 5728, '<td valign="top">A step backwards would have made it a little more difficult to spot Waldo. But the idea is good. At first I was going to say it is a little too dark, but you really need it that way to try to blend Waldo into the shadows. Good luck....</td>', 'A step backwards would have made it a little more difficult to spot Waldo. But the idea is good. At first I was going to say it is a little too dark, but you really need it that way to try to blend Waldo into the shadows. Good luck....', '2003-02-14 06:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(215280, 12098, 5728, '<td valign="top">This thought also crossed my mind but we don''t have any stadiums near here. Good idea though and you have met the challenge bang on. I can''t seem to spot your main focal point in this photo.</td>', 'This thought also crossed my mind but we don''t have any stadiums near here. Good idea though and you have met the challenge bang on. I can''t seem to spot your main focal point in this photo.', '2003-02-14 06:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(215281, 12267, 5728, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo but wasn''t that a little too cold under all that snow? That is a real Waldo right? Okay, great composition, the colors of that sky out the back are magnificent. Those birds bother  me a little taking my attention away from the main theme but the poor guy would have froze if you had waited for them to fly away. I mean, that is a person isn''t it? In someways it resembles a kind of statue. Very good capture....brrrrrr</td>', 'Excellent photo but wasn''t that a little too cold under all that snow? That is a real Waldo right? Okay, great composition, the colors of that sky out the back are magnificent. Those birds bother  me a little taking my attention away from the main theme but the poor guy would have froze if you had waited for them to fly away. I mean, that is a person isn''t it? In someways it resembles a kind of statue. Very good capture....brrrrrr', '2003-02-14 06:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(215282, 12215, 5728, '<td valign="top">Either those are BIG Lego blocks, or that is one heck of a small person, or it is a photo of Waldo :-))) Great idea anyway. I would have prefered the top block on the right to be pushed down properly, it kind of distracts me. Also the dark area on the right could have been either cropped out or lightened up some. But I like it, good one.</td>', 'Either those are BIG Lego blocks, or that is one heck of a small person, or it is a photo of Waldo :-))) Great idea anyway. I would have prefered the top block on the right to be pushed down properly, it kind of distracts me. Also the dark area on the right could have been either cropped out or lightened up some. But I like it, good one.', '2003-02-14 06:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(215286, 12138, 6097, '<td valign="top">Even though there were several of these sort of photos submitted, there were two that I really liked and this is one of them.  I like how you changed the color to the sepia.  It sort of gives it that camo feel.</td>', 'Even though there were several of these sort of photos submitted, there were two that I really liked and this is one of them.  I like how you changed the color to the sepia.  It sort of gives it that camo feel.', '2003-02-14 07:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(215287, 12071, 6097, '<td valign="top">I don''t quit get how this photo meets the challenge?  If I''m missing something please explain so I can reconsider.</td>', 'I don''t quit get how this photo meets the challenge?  If I''m missing something please explain so I can reconsider.', '2003-02-14 07:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(215288, 12175, 6097, '<td valign="top">Excellent!  This is one of my favorites for this challenge.  Very creative thinking!</td>', 'Excellent!  This is one of my favorites for this challenge.  Very creative thinking!', '2003-02-14 07:13:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(215289, 12127, 6097, '<td valign="top">Clever.</td>', 'Clever.', '2003-02-14 07:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(215290, 12093, 6097, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites for this challenge.  Thanks for taking a good photo as well as a photo with a person in it.  I really like the sepia color.</td>', 'One of my favorites for this challenge.  Thanks for taking a good photo as well as a photo with a person in it.  I really like the sepia color.', '2003-02-14 07:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(215291, 12250, 6097, '<td valign="top">This shot is my very favorite out of all of the stuffed animal pictures that were submitted for this challenge.  All of the colors work together nicely.  I really like how the little girls skin color is almost the same as that of the dolls.  Nice job!</td>', 'This shot is my very favorite out of all of the stuffed animal pictures that were submitted for this challenge.  All of the colors work together nicely.  I really like how the little girls skin color is almost the same as that of the dolls.  Nice job!', '2003-02-14 07:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(215292, 12281, 6097, '<td valign="top">Very cool effect!  Curious to see how it was done.  Great Job!  One of my favorites for this challenge.</td>', 'Very cool effect!  Curious to see how it was done.  Great Job!  One of my favorites for this challenge.', '2003-02-14 07:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(215293, 12298, 6097, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture.  But, I would have turned all of the coins upside down so that their back side was facing up so that there was only one person in the photo (George).  None the less, I like it.</td>', 'I really like this picture.  But, I would have turned all of the coins upside down so that their back side was facing up so that there was only one person in the photo (George).  None the less, I like it.', '2003-02-14 07:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(215298, 12261, 5158, '<td valign="top">LOL! Addresses the challenge-topic and it''s quality well. Of course it''s more a snap-shot, so technically not too much to write about it. I will still give it good marks because it captures well my thoughts about this "Waldo"-challenge to which I didn''t submit.</td>', 'LOL! Addresses the challenge-topic and it''s quality well. Of course it''s more a snap-shot, so technically not too much to write about it. I will still give it good marks because it captures well my thoughts about this "Waldo"-challenge to which I didn''t submit.', '2003-02-14 07:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(215299, 12298, 5158, '<td valign="top">I like it, One of the few submissions with something to search and find (although it''s pretty easy). Like the color, light and reflection. You might have covered the dollar-bill even more. Good luck!</td>', 'I like it, One of the few submissions with something to search and find (although it''s pretty easy). Like the color, light and reflection. You might have covered the dollar-bill even more. Good luck!', '2003-02-14 08:01:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(215301, 12127, 5158, '<td valign="top">Great and unique idea in this contest: you seems to be the only one having a Waldo-puzzle. The reflection disturbe a little, but the colors are nice. good luck with this well fitting submission.</td>', 'Great and unique idea in this contest: you seems to be the only one having a Waldo-puzzle. The reflection disturbe a little, but the colors are nice. good luck with this well fitting submission.', '2003-02-14 08:03:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(215302, 12217, 5158, '<td valign="top">Great idea! Surprising that this is the only submission of this kind. Like how you look at the screen. Waldos shadow is simply great as well as himselves.<br/>the light on your face and on the monitor disturbes a little though, but probably otherwise the shadow wouldn''t work well. You should have cropped it more at the right side too.<br/>Still one of the few good submissions this time.</td>', 'Great idea! Surprising that this is the only submission of this kind. Like how you look at the screen. Waldos shadow is simply great as well as himselves.the light on your face and on the monitor disturbes a little though, but probably otherwise the shadow wouldn''t work well. You should have cropped it more at the right side too.Still one of the few good submissions this time.', '2003-02-14 08:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(215325, 12093, 4793, '<td valign="top">I think I found your Waldo on the bridge. Nice photo, is this bridge in Canada?</td>', 'I think I found your Waldo on the bridge. Nice photo, is this bridge in Canada?', '2003-02-14 10:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(215333, 12172, 4793, '<td valign="top">Nice winter shot, the tracks are leading me to the tree, is Waldo behind the tree?  Your composition is good, colors are crisp, good DOF.</td>', 'Nice winter shot, the tracks are leading me to the tree, is Waldo behind the tree?  Your composition is good, colors are crisp, good DOF.', '2003-02-14 10:48:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(215335, 12229, 4793, '<td valign="top">No, where are you? The picture is to dark.</td>', 'No, where are you? The picture is to dark.', '2003-02-14 10:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(215338, 12228, 4793, '<td valign="top">I would like to see the flowers more focused and cropped just above the petals on the red flower, nice border.</td>', 'I would like to see the flowers more focused and cropped just above the petals on the red flower, nice border.', '2003-02-14 10:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(215358, 12110, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunrise or sunset as is.  A little lighter and might have been able to find Waldo.  As is can\''t see much of anything.  For an other challenge would be a 10.  For Waldo, no hope of even being able to spot him if I knew where he was.  I see the silioutte and am upping the score by 2 more points.</td>', 'Beautiful sunrise or sunset as is.  A little lighter and might have been able to find Waldo.  As is can\''t see much of anything.  For an other challenge would be a 10.  For Waldo, no hope of even being able to spot him if I knew where he was.  I see the silioutte and am upping the score by 2 more points.', '2003-02-14 12:03:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(215361, 12147, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is a really great photo.  I like the steps especially.  They are a nice touch and addition.  just can''t find Waldo.  When I do I''ll add 2 points and you''ll have a really nice score.  If he''s in the window, he can''t been seen and won''t count.  I''m looking in the bushes and stairwell.  Anyway, it really is a nice photo.  When I find Waldo it meet the challenge well.  Looks like he might be laying on the steps with his leg at the rail?  Here''s your 2 extra for an 8 total</td>', 'This is a really great photo.  I like the steps especially.  They are a nice touch and addition.  just can''t find Waldo.  When I do I''ll add 2 points and you''ll have a really nice score.  If he''s in the window, he can''t been seen and won''t count.  I''m looking in the bushes and stairwell.  Anyway, it really is a nice photo.  When I find Waldo it meet the challenge well.  Looks like he might be laying on the steps with his leg at the rail?  Here''s your 2 extra for an 8 total', '2003-02-14 12:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(215362, 12122, 6701, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot.  Great lines, in both the conceled person and the sheet.</td>', 'I like this a lot.  Great lines, in both the conceled person and the sheet.', '2003-02-14 12:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(215363, 12212, 6701, '<td valign="top">Good color, but the reflections above the booths sorta detract from it.  I like the positioning a lot, and it fits the concept well.</td>', 'Good color, but the reflections above the booths sorta detract from it.  I like the positioning a lot, and it fits the concept well.', '2003-02-14 12:12:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(215364, 12085, 6701, '<td valign="top">Great contrast</td>', 'Great contrast', '2003-02-14 12:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(215367, 12250, 6701, '<td valign="top">Oh.. another picture of someone in a pile of stuffed animals.  Cute.</td>', 'Oh.. another picture of someone in a pile of stuffed animals.  Cute.', '2003-02-14 12:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(215368, 12219, 4648, '<td valign="top">Nicely focused photo.  Red is over dominating the other colors and fading into them.  I like the statue, or whatever, in the front of the photo.  Still searching the windows, roof tops, and background for Waldo.  Will upgrade the score 2 points when I find Waldo.  Can barely see someone in the black pick-up.  there''s Waldo, and here''s the 2 extra points.</td>', 'Nicely focused photo.  Red is over dominating the other colors and fading into them.  I like the statue, or whatever, in the front of the photo.  Still searching the windows, roof tops, and background for Waldo.  Will upgrade the score 2 points when I find Waldo.  Can barely see someone in the black pick-up.  there''s Waldo, and here''s the 2 extra points.', '2003-02-14 12:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(215376, 12209, 1041, '<td valign="top">Challenge met.  Not exactly difficult to find her, but met nonetheless.  I like this photo a lot.  I like the shape created by those two trees, and the texture and colors of them.  Putting a face in the gap between the trees is just really clever and works well in the photo even outside of the challenge.  The lighting on the right side of the photo is a little brighter than perfect, but nothing too distracting.  I was re-reading some of the forum discussions on dodging and burning, this might be a good pic to try it on.  Great entry  :)</td>', 'Challenge met.  Not exactly difficult to find her, but met nonetheless.  I like this photo a lot.  I like the shape created by those two trees, and the texture and colors of them.  Putting a face in the gap between the trees is just really clever and works well in the photo even outside of the challenge.  The lighting on the right side of the photo is a little brighter than perfect, but nothing too distracting.  I was re-reading some of the forum discussions on dodging and burning, this might be a good pic to try it on.  Great entry  :)', '2003-02-14 12:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(215377, 12228, 1041, '<td valign="top">Challenge met.  I''m not sure whether I personally would''ve chosen Bin Laden, but it''s certainly a name and face with notoriety and a large recognition factor.  As for the photo, I like the composition with the flowers quite a lot, and the focus on the flowers is good, too, as is the DOF.  I would''ve probably cleaned some of the leaves of the stems before placing the flowers to make the diagonal lines more simple.  Your lighting is a little uneven, the white flower is a little bright in spots (although still acceptable, no real blow-out), and the red flower too dark.  I wonder if adding light from the right would have evened this out a bit.  I also would''ve used less of a frame (remove the one pixel white on the inside, and make the black thinner), but I realize frames are very much a personal taste thing.  Overall, good job.  :)</td>', 'Challenge met.  I''m not sure whether I personally would''ve chosen Bin Laden, but it''s certainly a name and face with notoriety and a large recognition factor.  As for the photo, I like the composition with the flowers quite a lot, and the focus on the flowers is good, too, as is the DOF.  I would''ve probably cleaned some of the leaves of the stems before placing the flowers to make the diagonal lines more simple.  Your lighting is a little uneven, the white flower is a little bright in spots (although still acceptable, no real blow-out), and the red flower too dark.  I wonder if adding light from the right would have evened this out a bit.  I also would''ve used less of a frame (remove the one pixel white on the inside, and make the black thinner), but I realize frames are very much a personal taste thing.  Overall, good job.  :)', '2003-02-14 12:46:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(215383, 12163, 1041, '<td valign="top">Challenge met, even though it''s not too hard to spot her behind the books.  Engineering, huh?  Your focus, and colors and technical aspects and all are fine for this shot.  I know this is just a guidance and not a must, and sometimes meant to be broken, but personally I would prefer if the eye wan''t place smackbang in the center of the photo.  That way, that''s really all you look at, if it was off-center, I think the viewer would "browse" the photo more, take in the different book titles, etc, more.</td>', 'Challenge met, even though it''s not too hard to spot her behind the books.  Engineering, huh?  Your focus, and colors and technical aspects and all are fine for this shot.  I know this is just a guidance and not a must, and sometimes meant to be broken, but personally I would prefer if the eye wan''t place smackbang in the center of the photo.  That way, that''s really all you look at, if it was off-center, I think the viewer would "browse" the photo more, take in the different book titles, etc, more.', '2003-02-14 12:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(215385, 12175, 1041, '<td valign="top">Hehe.  Great idea, and title, and challenge met to boot (no pun intended ;).  The diagonal running through this photo really leads the eye, the focus and DOF is good, too.  I like this shot a lot already, but there are a couple of things that you can do that would make it even stronger IMO.  Cropping.  Crop out the right side just at the end of the wall.  The stuff in the top right corner disappears, and, even more important, the line of shoes now seems to run on forever outside of the photo.  To balance that, I would crop a bit of the left and bottom of your photo, too, so that the first shoe isn''t fully visible.  You won''t be able to make it look like that line continues unless you crop a lot, but I don''t think it''s necessary.</td>', 'Hehe.  Great idea, and title, and challenge met to boot (no pun intended ;).  The diagonal running through this photo really leads the eye, the focus and DOF is good, too.  I like this shot a lot already, but there are a couple of things that you can do that would make it even stronger IMO.  Cropping.  Crop out the right side just at the end of the wall.  The stuff in the top right corner disappears, and, even more important, the line of shoes now seems to run on forever outside of the photo.  To balance that, I would crop a bit of the left and bottom of your photo, too, so that the first shoe isn''t fully visible.  You won''t be able to make it look like that line continues unless you crop a lot, but I don''t think it''s necessary.', '2003-02-14 12:57:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(215386, 12261, 2000, '<td valign="top">Must be hard to drink with that box over the head.  Colors ok, though the pic is a bit boring.</td>', 'Must be hard to drink with that box over the head.  Colors ok, though the pic is a bit boring.', '2003-02-14 12:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(215387, 12122, 2000, '<td valign="top">I like this effect, although there may be a bit much in the backlighting - the person is too visible for this type of shot.  Nice work.</td>', 'I like this effect, although there may be a bit much in the backlighting - the person is too visible for this type of shot.  Nice work.', '2003-02-14 12:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(215389, 12255, 1041, '<td valign="top">Nice infrared.  And you''ve met the challenge, it isn''t exactly hard to spot him on that bench, but it is a person in an otherwise person-less photo.  I like the composition and the placement of your objects.  The dark tree trunk against the (almost) white leaves is nice, and the guy on the bench is nicely framed by it.  I''m not too sure about your choice of color, I think personally, I''d prefer a b&amp;w approach, but I''d have to see it to be sure.</td>', 'Nice infrared.  And you''ve met the challenge, it isn''t exactly hard to spot him on that bench, but it is a person in an otherwise person-less photo.  I like the composition and the placement of your objects.  The dark tree trunk against the (almost) white leaves is nice, and the guy on the bench is nicely framed by it.  I''m not too sure about your choice of color, I think personally, I''d prefer a b&w approach, but I''d have to see it to be sure.', '2003-02-14 13:01:08.000000', NULL, 1),
