(215462, 12208, 2000, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of the scene at the very end of Men In Black where the creatures are playing with the marbles.</td>', 'Reminds me of the scene at the very end of Men In Black where the creatures are playing with the marbles.', '2003-02-14 15:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(215465, 12251, 2000, '<td valign="top">The people aren''t really hidden, per se, but unobvious enough to make the photo interesting.  I think the exposure might be a bit warm here, given the very bright upper hald of the picture.</td>', 'The people aren''t really hidden, per se, but unobvious enough to make the photo interesting.  I think the exposure might be a bit warm here, given the very bright upper hald of the picture.', '2003-02-14 15:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(215466, 12063, 2000, '<td valign="top">Which way did who go?  Cool shot, but I don''t see a person.</td>', 'Which way did who go?  Cool shot, but I don''t see a person.', '2003-02-14 15:19:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(215467, 12121, 2000, '<td valign="top">Colors ok, subject ok, focus not so good.  I don''t really see anything in focus here.</td>', 'Colors ok, subject ok, focus not so good.  I don''t really see anything in focus here.', '2003-02-14 15:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(215468, 12059, 2000, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  Reminds me a bit of some shots from Reflections challenge.  DOF good, and very creative.</td>', 'Cool shot.  Reminds me a bit of some shots from Reflections challenge.  DOF good, and very creative.', '2003-02-14 15:21:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(215469, 12167, 2000, '<td valign="top">The person here is quite well hidden, though I can see him against the light.  This is a very nice shot.</td>', 'The person here is quite well hidden, though I can see him against the light.  This is a very nice shot.', '2003-02-14 15:21:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(215471, 12212, 2000, '<td valign="top">Sehr Gut - schoenen foto mit eine Person.  Enough German - nice interpretation of the challenge.  Is this in a train station?</td>', 'Sehr Gut - schoenen foto mit eine Person.  Enough German - nice interpretation of the challenge.  Is this in a train station?', '2003-02-14 15:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(215472, 12090, 2000, '<td valign="top">I think for this to work as a hidden person, he''d have to be wearing all one color clothing so he blends in better.  Nice concept though.</td>', 'I think for this to work as a hidden person, he''d have to be wearing all one color clothing so he blends in better.  Nice concept though.', '2003-02-14 15:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(215473, 12237, 2000, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s creepy.  Nice concept.</td>', 'Wow, that''s creepy.  Nice concept.', '2003-02-14 15:25:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(215474, 12215, 2000, '<td valign="top">Lego Expo?  But the guy''s not really hidden, so maybe not quite on the challenge in my view.  Also, the void on the right may be a bit too wide.</td>', 'Lego Expo?  But the guy''s not really hidden, so maybe not quite on the challenge in my view.  Also, the void on the right may be a bit too wide.', '2003-02-14 15:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(215475, 12233, 2000, '<td valign="top">Creepy.  The human eyes are looking away from the camera, and while I''m not certain if that was intentional, I think it hurts the picture since all the other eyes face forwards.</td>', 'Creepy.  The human eyes are looking away from the camera, and while I''m not certain if that was intentional, I think it hurts the picture since all the other eyes face forwards.', '2003-02-14 15:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(215478, 12133, 2000, '<td valign="top">Cute.</td>', 'Cute.', '2003-02-14 15:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(215503, 12168, 1041, '<td valign="top">I''ve just spent some time looking through your photo, and I can''t see anyone.  Sorry.  I''m wondering if you meant to submit this to the Perspective challenge and picked the wrong one by mistake or whether I need glasses.  Unfortunately, that means the photo does not meet the challenge in my opinion.  As for the photo itself, I like the red contrasting with the green, and your focus and sharpness if good, too.  There isn''t enough of a central focal point although one of the buds (the one close to the middle of the photo) could be it.   Maybe isolating less leaves and one of those buds would''ve made this less busy and allowed the viewer to figure out easier what to focus on.</td>', 'I''ve just spent some time looking through your photo, and I can''t see anyone.  Sorry.  I''m wondering if you meant to submit this to the Perspective challenge and picked the wrong one by mistake or whether I need glasses.  Unfortunately, that means the photo does not meet the challenge in my opinion.  As for the photo itself, I like the red contrasting with the green, and your focus and sharpness if good, too.  There isn''t enough of a central focal point although one of the buds (the one close to the middle of the photo) could be it.   Maybe isolating less leaves and one of those buds would''ve made this less busy and allowed the viewer to figure out easier what to focus on.', '2003-02-14 16:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(215504, 12269, 1041, '<td valign="top">Challenge mt.  Waldo looks like he''s changing a tire, or doing something with the tires.  Overall, I think the photo is a little dark (even though that does help you hide Waldo better).  B&amp;w was definitely necessary since I think Waldo might wear some really bright orange suit with white reflectors.  LOL.  Good catch to realize that could work for this challenge.  :)</td>', 'Challenge mt.  Waldo looks like he''s changing a tire, or doing something with the tires.  Overall, I think the photo is a little dark (even though that does help you hide Waldo better).  B&w was definitely necessary since I think Waldo might wear some really bright orange suit with white reflectors.  LOL.  Good catch to realize that could work for this challenge.  :)', '2003-02-14 16:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(215509, 12281, 2000, '<td valign="top">Van Gogh''s Sunflowers, ok.  Meeting the challenge?  I don''t see a person, so no.  OK - is it the eye in the flower?</td>', 'Van Gogh''s Sunflowers, ok.  Meeting the challenge?  I don''t see a person, so no.  OK - is it the eye in the flower?', '2003-02-14 16:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
