(215767, 12075, 1707, '<td valign="top">very shinny! excuse my ignorance, but what are they? just a bit dark near the bottom of the photo.</td>', 'very shinny! excuse my ignorance, but what are they? just a bit dark near the bottom of the photo.', '2003-02-15 06:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(215768, 12219, 1707, '<td valign="top">nice way to frame the photo with the structure but I think it would have work just a bit more if more of the building was present; showing as a landscape instead of a portrait.</td>', 'nice way to frame the photo with the structure but I think it would have work just a bit more if more of the building was present; showing as a landscape instead of a portrait.', '2003-02-15 06:01:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(215769, 12168, 1707, '<td valign="top">not sure what you mean by "frozen in stone" but lovely green.  The gray sport on the leaf is distracting.</td>', 'not sure what you mean by "frozen in stone" but lovely green.  The gray sport on the leaf is distracting.', '2003-02-15 06:03:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(215770, 12071, 1707, '<td valign="top">what an adorable child!  just beautiful how you captured his happiness.  A good choice in using the brown tint. It gives texture to his skin and hair.</td>', 'what an adorable child!  just beautiful how you captured his happiness.  A good choice in using the brown tint. It gives texture to his skin and hair.', '2003-02-15 06:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(215771, 12082, 1707, '<td valign="top">I wish the car wasn''t there.</td>', 'I wish the car wasn''t there.', '2003-02-15 06:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(215772, 12123, 1707, '<td valign="top">I like your sense of humor.</td>', 'I like your sense of humor.', '2003-02-15 06:12:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(215773, 12127, 1707, '<td valign="top">love your idea but the light isn''t distributed well.  Try using multiple lamps on several sides of your board next time</td>', 'love your idea but the light isn''t distributed well.  Try using multiple lamps on several sides of your board next time', '2003-02-15 06:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(215784, 12142, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very interesting. I like it.</td>', 'Very interesting. I like it.', '2003-02-15 07:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(215785, 12071, 3306, '<td valign="top">Cute but obviously doesn''t satisfy the theme. You should have used this in a different contest and you would have done much better.</td>', 'Cute but obviously doesn''t satisfy the theme. You should have used this in a different contest and you would have done much better.', '2003-02-15 07:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(215786, 12054, 3306, '<td valign="top">I don''t see the person although from the look on the cats face it looks like he ate him! A good picture that would have done better in a different contest.</td>', 'I don''t see the person although from the look on the cats face it looks like he ate him! A good picture that would have done better in a different contest.', '2003-02-15 07:32:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(215787, 12154, 3306, '<td valign="top">Ah, the old reflection in the window trick!!</td>', 'Ah, the old reflection in the window trick!!', '2003-02-15 07:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(215788, 12256, 3306, '<td valign="top">Well done picture. Lighting and focus is good. The only problem I have is that it seems as if you had this picture and you just decided to use it for the contest and didn''t give much thought to actually setting it up. The reason I feel this way is because you have 3 people in your picture not 1. Therefore, in comparison to the pictures that were done with the theme in mind, I had to knock you down a little. Sorry, but good luck anyway.</td>', 'Well done picture. Lighting and focus is good. The only problem I have is that it seems as if you had this picture and you just decided to use it for the contest and didn''t give much thought to actually setting it up. The reason I feel this way is because you have 3 people in your picture not 1. Therefore, in comparison to the pictures that were done with the theme in mind, I had to knock you down a little. Sorry, but good luck anyway.', '2003-02-15 07:40:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(215789, 12224, 3306, '<td valign="top">Good camouflage. Focus is a little soft. Not a terribly interesting picture but definitely satisfies the theme.</td>', 'Good camouflage. Focus is a little soft. Not a terribly interesting picture but definitely satisfies the theme.', '2003-02-15 07:43:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(215918, 12071, 3018, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what to do with this picture.  I like it so much, well lighted, focused, and very nice expression.  Colors are great.  But in my opinion it does not meet the challenge.  I hate to take off a couple of points because of this.  Don''t get me wrong, your picture is great, just not on topic.</td>', 'I don''t know what to do with this picture.  I like it so much, well lighted, focused, and very nice expression.  Colors are great.  But in my opinion it does not meet the challenge.  I hate to take off a couple of points because of this.  Don''t get me wrong, your picture is great, just not on topic.', '2003-02-15 11:12:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(215930, 12127, 3018, '<td valign="top">Yes, I did! Be careful with the lighting so that you don''t have those hotspots.</td>', 'Yes, I did! Be careful with the lighting so that you don''t have those hotspots.', '2003-02-15 11:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(215934, 12053, 3018, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. The sepia tone helps hiding her. Seems a bit overcompressed.</td>', 'Nice idea. The sepia tone helps hiding her. Seems a bit overcompressed.', '2003-02-15 11:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(215939, 12093, 3018, '<td valign="top">I think I can make out a person in the middle of the bridge.  Nice picture!</td>', 'I think I can make out a person in the middle of the bridge.  Nice picture!', '2003-02-15 11:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(215941, 12142, 3018, '<td valign="top">Wow! Very cool idea.  Good composition.This is one of my favorites.  Good luck!</td>', 'Wow! Very cool idea.  Good composition.This is one of my favorites.  Good luck!', '2003-02-15 11:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(215944, 12224, 3018, '<td valign="top">Gave me the creeps!  Looks like a ghost.  Good luck!</td>', 'Gave me the creeps!  Looks like a ghost.  Good luck!', '2003-02-15 11:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(215946, 12092, 3018, '<td valign="top">Nice moment. But you didn''t meet the challenge.</td>', 'Nice moment. But you didn''t meet the challenge.', '2003-02-15 11:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(215981, 12294, 3419, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm - can''t find your person in this photo, so am scoring it as "doesn''t meet challenge". Feel free to PM me if you disagree. Focus is also extremely soft - distracting - would prefer more crispness. Lighting is nice, in that it casts shadows, but bright reflections off the toys are also distracting.</td>', 'Hmmmm - can''t find your person in this photo, so am scoring it as "doesn''t meet challenge". Feel free to PM me if you disagree. Focus is also extremely soft - distracting - would prefer more crispness. Lighting is nice, in that it casts shadows, but bright reflections off the toys are also distracting.', '2003-02-15 12:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(215987, 12196, 3419, '<td valign="top">I can see a bit of a reflection in the vehicle door, but it doesn''t provide enough detail for me to be able to distinguish it as a person - and I''ve adjusted my monitor''s brightness and contrast settings to in my attempts to locate your person. I have to therefore, rate this photo as "doesn''t meet the challenge". Sorry.</td>', 'I can see a bit of a reflection in the vehicle door, but it doesn''t provide enough detail for me to be able to distinguish it as a person - and I''ve adjusted my monitor''s brightness and contrast settings to in my attempts to locate your person. I have to therefore, rate this photo as "doesn''t meet the challenge". Sorry.', '2003-02-15 12:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(215988, 12098, 3419, '<td valign="top">Nice use of the horizontal pattern to hide your person who is lying down 1/3 from the top. I find the power pole at the top a little distracting - would prefer it wasn''t there. Lighting renders this photo flat. Perhaps shooting under different daylight conditions would create more dramatic shadows?</td>', 'Nice use of the horizontal pattern to hide your person who is lying down 1/3 from the top. I find the power pole at the top a little distracting - would prefer it wasn''t there. Lighting renders this photo flat. Perhaps shooting under different daylight conditions would create more dramatic shadows?', '2003-02-15 12:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(215989, 12082, 3419, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, but I don''t consider this highly visible shadow to be a "hidden" person. Would prefer that the car and ?fence posts? were not shown. If they were cropped out, this would be a more interesting photo. Photo looks a little washed out in the top half. Maybe playing with contrast would improve this?</td>', 'Nice concept, but I don''t consider this highly visible shadow to be a "hidden" person. Would prefer that the car and ?fence posts? were not shown. If they were cropped out, this would be a more interesting photo. Photo looks a little washed out in the top half. Maybe playing with contrast would improve this?', '2003-02-15 12:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(215990, 12154, 3419, '<td valign="top">Nice job of camouflaging your person. Perhaps contrast adjustment would result in the face being more visible? As such, I can see only your forearm. Color overall looks a little washed out.</td>', 'Nice job of camouflaging your person. Perhaps contrast adjustment would result in the face being more visible? As such, I can see only your forearm. Color overall looks a little washed out.', '2003-02-15 12:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(215991, 12168, 3419, '<td valign="top">No hidden person, therefore, does not meet the challenge. I think I can see something in the background in the top right quadrant, but there''s not enough detail for me to identify it.</td>', 'No hidden person, therefore, does not meet the challenge. I think I can see something in the background in the top right quadrant, but there''s not enough detail for me to identify it.', '2003-02-15 12:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(216040, 12079, 4815, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Technical excellence and a most creative concept. Nice diffuse lighting on the peas. And an attractive strong catchlight in the eye. A good graphic composition.</td>', 'Great shot. Technical excellence and a most creative concept. Nice diffuse lighting on the peas. And an attractive strong catchlight in the eye. A good graphic composition.', '2003-02-15 17:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(216041, 12122, 4815, '<td valign="top">My fav foto this week hands down. Love the folds in the draped sheet. A small thing , but I personally would like the hands portion a tad more off centre. Another very minor quibble is the squarish texture embedded in the sheet. I find this attracts my attention and diverts it away from the power of the delecate figure. The concept is superior to most of the shots of this week. Technically a very good shot. Tons of expressive power in this image that speaks well of your creative talent.</td>', 'My fav foto this week hands down. Love the folds in the draped sheet. A small thing , but I personally would like the hands portion a tad more off centre. Another very minor quibble is the squarish texture embedded in the sheet. I find this attracts my attention and diverts it away from the power of the delecate figure. The concept is superior to most of the shots of this week. Technically a very good shot. Tons of expressive power in this image that speaks well of your creative talent.', '2003-02-15 18:03:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(216043, 12107, 4815, '<td valign="top">A bold silhouette image with beautiful subtle hues in the sky contrasting with a strong line study and blazing sign. The sun, the red sign and the figure all compete for my attention visually. Any one of those powerful elements in combination with just the sky would be a winning combo in my opinion. Such as the figure, three tiers of stairs and the sky. The scribble of treeline along the bottom is a perfect compositional base. A great idea that should earn you many other compliments. Good luck.</td>', 'A bold silhouette image with beautiful subtle hues in the sky contrasting with a strong line study and blazing sign. The sun, the red sign and the figure all compete for my attention visually. Any one of those powerful elements in combination with just the sky would be a winning combo in my opinion. Such as the figure, three tiers of stairs and the sky. The scribble of treeline along the bottom is a perfect compositional base. A great idea that should earn you many other compliments. Good luck.', '2003-02-15 18:11:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(216045, 12187, 4815, '<td valign="top">I am in total awe of your compositional choice. Many people may not agree with the shards of skewed building bits poking in here and lopped off there. But I really am envious of this marvellous dynamic expression of line and shape. The token figure is well disguised. Such a fabulous shot. The greys are balanced well in proportion to the vivacious blues plus that elegant complimentary kiss of yellow. A unique personal image that says much about your sense of color and graphic design. Very well done.</td>', 'I am in total awe of your compositional choice. Many people may not agree with the shards of skewed building bits poking in here and lopped off there. But I really am envious of this marvellous dynamic expression of line and shape. The token figure is well disguised. Such a fabulous shot. The greys are balanced well in proportion to the vivacious blues plus that elegant complimentary kiss of yellow. A unique personal image that says much about your sense of color and graphic design. Very well done.', '2003-02-15 18:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(216047, 12140, 4815, '<td valign="top">Great tongue in cheek shot. Love the spooky dino silhouettes with threatening shadows. The egg is an unusual visual prop that reminds me of a spaceship. I admire your off the wall creativity and humour. Those are very rare qualities in a photographer that can sometimes be lost in the pressures of competition. Therefore I genuinely encourage you to explore your special vision which means more than any DPC score.</td>', 'Great tongue in cheek shot. Love the spooky dino silhouettes with threatening shadows. The egg is an unusual visual prop that reminds me of a spaceship. I admire your off the wall creativity and humour. Those are very rare qualities in a photographer that can sometimes be lost in the pressures of competition. Therefore I genuinely encourage you to explore your special vision which means more than any DPC score.', '2003-02-15 18:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(216050, 12255, 4815, '<td valign="top">A pleasant gentle image. The cottony leaves contrast well to the bold trunk and branches. Although the water highlights command much attention fromthe viewer they do suit the high key image. Waldo is not disguised in the foto which may dock you a few points from other voters. But not me. A long time exposure with a ghost waldo would be an interesting possibility, too. A good solid image.</td>', 'A pleasant gentle image. The cottony leaves contrast well to the bold trunk and branches. Although the water highlights command much attention fromthe viewer they do suit the high key image. Waldo is not disguised in the foto which may dock you a few points from other voters. But not me. A long time exposure with a ghost waldo would be an interesting possibility, too. A good solid image.', '2003-02-15 18:39:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(216051, 12212, 4815, '<td valign="top">A good creative angle on the challenge for this week. I like the bold repetition of the yellow booth sides and phone signs. This might even work in B&amp;W. Two very minor negative points hardly worth mentioning are the glaring highlight reflections  from the lights and the black pants blending in with the black wall border. Dramatic cropping into a panorama would be another alternative. A good overall photo.</td>', 'A good creative angle on the challenge for this week. I like the bold repetition of the yellow booth sides and phone signs. This might even work in B&W. Two very minor negative points hardly worth mentioning are the glaring highlight reflections  from the lights and the black pants blending in with the black wall border. Dramatic cropping into a panorama would be another alternative. A good overall photo.', '2003-02-15 18:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(216052, 12066, 3419, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but I cannot see your hidden person.</td>', 'Nice photo, but I cannot see your hidden person.', '2003-02-15 18:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(216053, 12222, 4815, '<td valign="top">An interesting approach to this week''s theme. This is a good idea. Some people may be a wee picky about those jaggy artifacts, snow not being white enough and no technical actua; presence of a person. Bah humbug. This is good creative effort in the right direction. Extra points from this corner for not stating the obvious.</td>', 'An interesting approach to this week''s theme. This is a good idea. Some people may be a wee picky about those jaggy artifacts, snow not being white enough and no technical actua; presence of a person. Bah humbug. This is good creative effort in the right direction. Extra points from this corner for not stating the obvious.', '2003-02-15 18:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(216056, 12261, 4815, '<td valign="top">Ha Ha ! If scores would be gauged according to humour you would get a 10. Your idea is commendable. The bottle and box are excelent choices of stage props. This appears to be an off the cuff idea that you attempted to capture at the moment of inception. Spontaneity and creativity are worth developing. Unfortunately you may have to compromise some of those exceptional talents in order to acheive a lofty score. And that would make me sad. Anyways, could I suggest a more provocative visual statement by honing in on some of your compositional and lighting cues. If Waldo was sick and tired he might be in a darker more moody environment. Perhaps a spotlight or ray of light from an opened door emphasizing your power props (box and bottle) with ample shadow. Backlighting behind the box to catch bottle highlights for instance. You might even consider doing your image in B&amp;W to further build the mood. Basically you hack and chop away at every visual element that does not aid in speaking your message. In this instance you might consider different lighting and camera position to eliminate the whiteness of concrete, the watch, clothing detail, chair and curtain. I do not intend this as a harsh criticism. Just alternative ways that may affect the presentation and meaning of your image. I believe that you are a good photographer that holds much promise.</td>', 'Ha Ha ! If scores would be gauged according to humour you would get a 10. Your idea is commendable. The bottle and box are excelent choices of stage props. This appears to be an off the cuff idea that you attempted to capture at the moment of inception. Spontaneity and creativity are worth developing. Unfortunately you may have to compromise some of those exceptional talents in order to acheive a lofty score. And that would make me sad. Anyways, could I suggest a more provocative visual statement by honing in on some of your compositional and lighting cues. If Waldo was sick and tired he might be in a darker more moody environment. Perhaps a spotlight or ray of light from an opened door emphasizing your power props (box and bottle) with ample shadow. Backlighting behind the box to catch bottle highlights for instance. You might even consider doing your image in B&W to further build the mood. Basically you hack and chop away at every visual element that does not aid in speaking your message. In this instance you might consider different lighting and camera position to eliminate the whiteness of concrete, the watch, clothing detail, chair and curtain. I do not intend this as a harsh criticism. Just alternative ways that may affect the presentation and meaning of your image. I believe that you are a good photographer that holds much promise.', '2003-02-15 19:13:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(216068, 12281, 3306, '<td valign="top">Your picture is one of my top picks this week. You definitley satisfy all aspects of the theme in a well taken photo. Great job.</td>', 'Your picture is one of my top picks this week. You definitley satisfy all aspects of the theme in a well taken photo. Great job.', '2003-02-15 20:14:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(216069, 12122, 3306, '<td valign="top">I really like the simplicity of your picture. One of my top picks this week.</td>', 'I really like the simplicity of your picture. One of my top picks this week.', '2003-02-15 20:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(216070, 12167, 3306, '<td valign="top">very nice. One of my top picks this week.</td>', 'very nice. One of my top picks this week.', '2003-02-15 20:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(216071, 12151, 3306, '<td valign="top">I like your picture. The colors are soft and set the mood. I would have cropped out the harsh white light in the top left and right of the picture. I see the people blurred near the umbrellas. Good one!</td>', 'I like your picture. The colors are soft and set the mood. I would have cropped out the harsh white light in the top left and right of the picture. I see the people blurred near the umbrellas. Good one!', '2003-02-15 20:16:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(216072, 12175, 3306, '<td valign="top">This is a very good composition. Focus and lighting  is good throughout. I like the pants on the subject. They hint at "Waldo"!!</td>', 'This is a very good composition. Focus and lighting  is good throughout. I like the pants on the subject. They hint at "Waldo"!!', '2003-02-15 20:16:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(216082, 12171, 4648, '<td valign="top">Thank you for the hint.  I thought that was Waldo.  I just followed the footsteps.  Just kidding.  This is a beautiful photo.  I especially like the contrast between the main tree in the middle and the other ones around.  Don''t know if you composed it that way or not.  Really like the focus on this.  Great job and beautiful photo.</td>', 'Thank you for the hint.  I thought that was Waldo.  I just followed the footsteps.  Just kidding.  This is a beautiful photo.  I especially like the contrast between the main tree in the middle and the other ones around.  Don''t know if you composed it that way or not.  Really like the focus on this.  Great job and beautiful photo.', '2003-02-15 20:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(216083, 12073, 4648, '<td valign="top">Nice try.  Cute idea.  BUT I can''t find Waldo.  He must be hidden, but spotable to qualify for the challenge.. Personally, I don''t think you qualified, unless one of those grains of sand is a bug of some sort.  But Waldo the crab is still in his hole as best I can tell.  Really cute idea though.  If I''m wrong, and he is visable I''ll find him and up the score by 2.</td>', 'Nice try.  Cute idea.  BUT I can''t find Waldo.  He must be hidden, but spotable to qualify for the challenge.. Personally, I don''t think you qualified, unless one of those grains of sand is a bug of some sort.  But Waldo the crab is still in his hole as best I can tell.  Really cute idea though.  If I''m wrong, and he is visable I''ll find him and up the score by 2.', '2003-02-15 20:59:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(216084, 12228, 4648, '<td valign="top">I sure hope he''s that easy for our guys to find.  Hate to hurt your flower, but hope it gets blown off the face of the earth.  It''s be a shame to do that to such a beautiful photo.  Cute idea, beautiful flowers, nice photo.  Way to go.</td>', 'I sure hope he''s that easy for our guys to find.  Hate to hurt your flower, but hope it gets blown off the face of the earth.  It''s be a shame to do that to such a beautiful photo.  Cute idea, beautiful flowers, nice photo.  Way to go.', '2003-02-15 21:00:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(216085, 12072, 4648, '<td valign="top">Really sharp, well focused and well lit photo of a really cute kid.  Shame it''s not for this challenge though, cause it would get a high score if it fit the challenge.  Maybe put a little more light on his face next time.</td>', 'Really sharp, well focused and well lit photo of a really cute kid.  Shame it''s not for this challenge though, cause it would get a high score if it fit the challenge.  Maybe put a little more light on his face next time.', '2003-02-15 21:02:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(216086, 12123, 4648, '<td valign="top">Get rid of that YELLOW border!  Cute one.  Nice sharp clean focus.  Bright for sure.  From the title I rather expected to see a "nut".  Good one.</td>', 'Get rid of that YELLOW border!  Cute one.  Nice sharp clean focus.  Bright for sure.  From the title I rather expected to see a "nut".  Good one.', '2003-02-15 21:05:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(216087, 12098, 4648, '<td valign="top">Not really.  A well photographed statidum, but not empty.  Someone fell and can''t get up.  Nice clean well focused.  Way to go.</td>', 'Not really.  A well photographed statidum, but not empty.  Someone fell and can''t get up.  Nice clean well focused.  Way to go.', '2003-02-15 21:08:22.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(216088, 12077, 4648, '<td valign="top">He''s not lost, I found him.  Chould have moved a smidgen one way or the other and he would have been inside one of the diamonds in the fence.  Then you could have titled it "In the diamond in the diamond".  Bad try at being funny.  But this is a good try at a good photograph.  Love the colors and the focus.  Really nice composition and well executed.  Great job.</td>', 'He''s not lost, I found him.  Chould have moved a smidgen one way or the other and he would have been inside one of the diamonds in the fence.  Then you could have titled it "In the diamond in the diamond".  Bad try at being funny.  But this is a good try at a good photograph.  Love the colors and the focus.  Really nice composition and well executed.  Great job.', '2003-02-15 21:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(216090, 12212, 4648, '<td valign="top">Well focused.  Nice bright colors and photo.  Well done.</td>', 'Well focused.  Nice bright colors and photo.  Well done.', '2003-02-15 21:13:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(216091, 12154, 4648, '<td valign="top">About all I can see is MAYBE a reflection of an ear ring at the top of his tail, but that''s all.  Can''t see a person, only an ear ring.  So don''t personally think that counts.  Otherwise it is a beautiful, beautiful photo of nature.  I really love it as a photo.  Georgeous squirrel.  If I could see waldo this would score high.  If I come back and find Waldo I''ll raise the score 2 points. Right now don''t feel it meets the challenge well enough.</td>', 'About all I can see is MAYBE a reflection of an ear ring at the top of his tail, but that''s all.  Can''t see a person, only an ear ring.  So don''t personally think that counts.  Otherwise it is a beautiful, beautiful photo of nature.  I really love it as a photo.  Georgeous squirrel.  If I could see waldo this would score high.  If I come back and find Waldo I''ll raise the score 2 points. Right now don''t feel it meets the challenge well enough.', '2003-02-15 21:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(216094, 12229, 4648, '<td valign="top">Needs to be a little lighter, photowise and also I could tell if that is a person''s leg I see behind the tree limb or not.  Nice composition, well focused and cropped, but needs to be lighter.  If, later I find Waldo I''ll raise the score by 2 points, but right now I don''t find a Waldo.</td>', 'Needs to be a little lighter, photowise and also I could tell if that is a person''s leg I see behind the tree limb or not.  Nice composition, well focused and cropped, but needs to be lighter.  If, later I find Waldo I''ll raise the score by 2 points, but right now I don''t find a Waldo.', '2003-02-15 21:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(216095, 12175, 4648, '<td valign="top">Love the angle of the shot and the great focus.  Well done.  Nice collection of tennis shoes.  Would have like a different collor back ground and base, too yellowish.  Rug appears to actually be beige.  A little more light would have been better.  But it is a nice clear photo and Waldo is there.</td>', 'Love the angle of the shot and the great focus.  Well done.  Nice collection of tennis shoes.  Would have like a different collor back ground and base, too yellowish.  Rug appears to actually be beige.  A little more light would have been better.  But it is a nice clear photo and Waldo is there.', '2003-02-15 21:26:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(216096, 12099, 4648, '<td valign="top">Needs to be sharper focused and more light.  That is not the back of Waldo on the right side is it?  That''s not hiding him.  Other than that I haven''t spotted Waldo.  If I come back and find him I''ll raise the score by 2 points, proving he''s there.  Like the sepia tone.</td>', 'Needs to be sharper focused and more light.  That is not the back of Waldo on the right side is it?  That''s not hiding him.  Other than that I haven''t spotted Waldo.  If I come back and find him I''ll raise the score by 2 points, proving he''s there.  Like the sepia tone.', '2003-02-15 21:30:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(216097, 12215, 4648, '<td valign="top">Now, that''s what I call red and white!.  Appears to be legos.  How did you get a person''s head in the window of a lego building.  You met the challenge but I don''t feel Waldo was really hidden in among things too well.  Better mixed better score.  It is nicely focused with good lighting.  Nice photo.  Don''t really like the black blank space on the right side.  To me it''s a waste and should have been cropped out.  But that''s just my opinion.</td>', 'Now, that''s what I call red and white!.  Appears to be legos.  How did you get a person''s head in the window of a lego building.  You met the challenge but I don''t feel Waldo was really hidden in among things too well.  Better mixed better score.  It is nicely focused with good lighting.  Nice photo.  Don''t really like the black blank space on the right side.  To me it''s a waste and should have been cropped out.  But that''s just my opinion.', '2003-02-15 21:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(216098, 12211, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.  Love the dam and the water falls.  Georgeous country side.  Hope the person walking the dog isn''t Waldo.  My idea of Waldo is hiding him somewhere in the photo, like where the blue thing is on the left side of the photo.  That would be a well hidden, but findable, Waldo.  To me this is a wonderful photo but has not met the challenge, and the score must reflect that.  If Waldo were hidden this would be a 9.  It''s one of the best photos as a photo.</td>', 'Beautiful photo.  Love the dam and the water falls.  Georgeous country side.  Hope the person walking the dog isn''t Waldo.  My idea of Waldo is hiding him somewhere in the photo, like where the blue thing is on the left side of the photo.  That would be a well hidden, but findable, Waldo.  To me this is a wonderful photo but has not met the challenge, and the score must reflect that.  If Waldo were hidden this would be a 9.  It''s one of the best photos as a photo.', '2003-02-15 21:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(216099, 12208, 4648, '<td valign="top">Needs to be lighter.  I can''t really tell what this is.  Is it a reflection, a shot through a window, or what.  I love the sky and clouds, and especailly like that they are really blue in what ever is in the top right corner.  I just can''t tell what this is a photo of.  Sorry.</td>', 'Needs to be lighter.  I can''t really tell what this is.  Is it a reflection, a shot through a window, or what.  I love the sky and clouds, and especailly like that they are really blue in what ever is in the top right corner.  I just can''t tell what this is a photo of.  Sorry.', '2003-02-15 21:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(216100, 12187, 2000, '<td valign="top">Very well hidden person - I can''t tell if he''s a reflection, or just in the reflection.  I like the colors in this shot, and the perspective is very nice.</td>', 'Very well hidden person - I can''t tell if he''s a reflection, or just in the reflection.  I like the colors in this shot, and the perspective is very nice.', '2003-02-15 21:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(216101, 12067, 2000, '<td valign="top">Not sure if the sepia effect helps this shot, as it seems to emphacize the glare on the right window.</td>', 'Not sure if the sepia effect helps this shot, as it seems to emphacize the glare on the right window.', '2003-02-15 21:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(216103, 12172, 2000, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, but I don''t see the person.  There may be too much in this photo, though I really like the deep blue of the sky.</td>', 'Very nice shot, but I don''t see the person.  There may be too much in this photo, though I really like the deep blue of the sky.', '2003-02-15 21:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(216104, 12080, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, sharp clear photo.  Don''t see Waldo in the cars, doors, or windows, but then I personally don''t feel these are legitemate hiding places. But if he were there would have to give credit for that.   Don''t see him up the tree, which would be a fabulous place to hide.  Just don''t see Waldo.  And it is such a really great photo.  If I come back and find Waldo I''ll raise the score by 2 points though.</td>', 'Beautiful, sharp clear photo.  Don''t see Waldo in the cars, doors, or windows, but then I personally don''t feel these are legitemate hiding places. But if he were there would have to give credit for that.   Don''t see him up the tree, which would be a fabulous place to hide.  Just don''t see Waldo.  And it is such a really great photo.  If I come back and find Waldo I''ll raise the score by 2 points though.', '2003-02-15 21:52:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(216106, 12309, 2000, '<td valign="top">That is one tiny kid.  A little yellow in hue over the picture though.</td>', 'That is one tiny kid.  A little yellow in hue over the picture though.', '2003-02-15 21:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(216107, 12073, 2000, '<td valign="top">is the person buried?</td>', 'is the person buried?', '2003-02-15 21:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(216109, 12267, 2000, '<td valign="top">very cool silouhette effect with the sunset.</td>', 'very cool silouhette effect with the sunset.', '2003-02-15 21:57:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(216110, 12137, 4648, '<td valign="top">Is the rock really that pint and the bushes that red?  Very unique.  Gives a pink cast to the whole photo, very soft pink.  That must be Waldo back on the patio in the corner.  Very hard to spot, but not really hidden either.  First thought he was the "thing" offsetting the center tall bush.  That would have been a perfect way to hide him.  Nice photo with really nice focus.  Wish it were a little lighter, but still nice photo.</td>', 'Is the rock really that pint and the bushes that red?  Very unique.  Gives a pink cast to the whole photo, very soft pink.  That must be Waldo back on the patio in the corner.  Very hard to spot, but not really hidden either.  First thought he was the "thing" offsetting the center tall bush.  That would have been a perfect way to hide him.  Nice photo with really nice focus.  Wish it were a little lighter, but still nice photo.', '2003-02-15 21:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(216112, 12224, 4648, '<td valign="top">Not personally appealing colorwise or photowise.  It''s too cluttered and busy, busy, busy.  Wonderful job of hiding Waldo.  Once you spot him, you can''t help but see him clearly.  But until you find him, it''s impossible to see him.  Great job of hiding Waldo.  I just personally don''t like the photo.  As a photo it''s a 3 with me.  As for hiding Waldo it''s a 10.  So will have to give you an 8 for the challenge.  But honestly I don''t like the photo that much.</td>', 'Not personally appealing colorwise or photowise.  It''s too cluttered and busy, busy, busy.  Wonderful job of hiding Waldo.  Once you spot him, you can''t help but see him clearly.  But until you find him, it''s impossible to see him.  Great job of hiding Waldo.  I just personally don''t like the photo.  As a photo it''s a 3 with me.  As for hiding Waldo it''s a 10.  So will have to give you an 8 for the challenge.  But honestly I don''t like the photo that much.', '2003-02-15 22:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(216113, 12138, 4648, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Would havel iked better in color.  Look at it carefully.  Looks like he has one long white ear and one furry ear.  Nicely focused.  Nice photo, but nothing outstanding.  Good snapshot in my opinion.</td>', 'Cute.  Would havel iked better in color.  Look at it carefully.  Looks like he has one long white ear and one furry ear.  Nicely focused.  Nice photo, but nothing outstanding.  Good snapshot in my opinion.', '2003-02-15 22:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(216116, 12095, 4648, '<td valign="top">Needs better focus, even fire switch is not clearly focused.  To me this is a snapshot, and not a really good one at that.</td>', 'Needs better focus, even fire switch is not clearly focused.  To me this is a snapshot, and not a really good one at that.', '2003-02-15 22:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(216119, 12153, 4648, '<td valign="top">Appears to be a reflective shot of Waldo.  And personally I do not feel that meets the challenge.  As a photo this needs a sharper focus.  A photo of lots of writing is very hard to get a doo focus of.  But even the frames don''t have a sharp focus.</td>', 'Appears to be a reflective shot of Waldo.  And personally I do not feel that meets the challenge.  As a photo this needs a sharper focus.  A photo of lots of writing is very hard to get a doo focus of.  But even the frames don''t have a sharp focus.', '2003-02-15 22:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(216122, 12180, 4648, '<td valign="top">Nice still life but Waldo''s not very well hidden.  To me personally, this does not meet the challenge.  We are to hid someone in amongst things, making it hard to find them.  You have Waldo right our there for everyone to see.  But it is a nice rich still life.</td>', 'Nice still life but Waldo''s not very well hidden.  To me personally, this does not meet the challenge.  We are to hid someone in amongst things, making it hard to find them.  You have Waldo right our there for everyone to see.  But it is a nice rich still life.', '2003-02-15 22:13:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(216124, 12275, 4648, '<td valign="top">I see him running on the right side, but not sure what I think about this.  Personally I though the challenge was to hid Waldo in amoung things but still be able to find him, with some searching.  To me this is not hiding him amoung things, but hiding him 2 ways:  1 - almost not in the photo and 2 - in the shadows so dark it makes spotting him very hard.  So the me you have not met the challenge, you and a lot of others.  But that''s just my personal opinion, not the judges opinion.  Since it is a well done photo I''ll split the score with you.</td>', 'I see him running on the right side, but not sure what I think about this.  Personally I though the challenge was to hid Waldo in amoung things but still be able to find him, with some searching.  To me this is not hiding him amoung things, but hiding him 2 ways:  1 - almost not in the photo and 2 - in the shadows so dark it makes spotting him very hard.  So the me you have not met the challenge, you and a lot of others.  But that''s just my personal opinion, not the judges opinion.  Since it is a well done photo I''ll split the score with you.', '2003-02-15 22:19:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(216126, 12251, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is an absolutely beautiful photo.  I love covered bridges, and this one is fantastic.  The photo itself is a 10.  BUT....personally I don''t feel hiding Waldo in the shadows is what was intended by the challenge.  He was to be hidden in among things, making it hard to distringuish him from the things.  So to me, and this is just my opinion, you have not meet the challenge.  And that is a real shame because this is such a wonderful photo.  Photo = 10;  hiding Waldo = 1 Score = 5.5.  I hate that too.</td>', 'This is an absolutely beautiful photo.  I love covered bridges, and this one is fantastic.  The photo itself is a 10.  BUT....personally I don''t feel hiding Waldo in the shadows is what was intended by the challenge.  He was to be hidden in among things, making it hard to distringuish him from the things.  So to me, and this is just my opinion, you have not meet the challenge.  And that is a real shame because this is such a wonderful photo.  Photo = 10;  hiding Waldo = 1 Score = 5.5.  I hate that too.', '2003-02-15 22:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(216131, 12281, 4648, '<td valign="top">Great job of hiding Waldo.  and Beautiful photo.  But come on, a mason jar.  Didn''t you have anything else to put the flowers in?  The are exquisite flowers and deserve to be shown off to the fullest in a beautiful vase.  A nice vace would hve helped so much.  Details, details.  they can make or break you.    This is probably the 2nd or 3rd best job of hiding Waldo of the challenge but the composition lacks badly.   Need to spend more time on the overall composition the next time.  This had the potential of being #1.</td>', 'Great job of hiding Waldo.  and Beautiful photo.  But come on, a mason jar.  Didn''t you have anything else to put the flowers in?  The are exquisite flowers and deserve to be shown off to the fullest in a beautiful vase.  A nice vace would hve helped so much.  Details, details.  they can make or break you.    This is probably the 2nd or 3rd best job of hiding Waldo of the challenge but the composition lacks badly.   Need to spend more time on the overall composition the next time.  This had the potential of being #1.', '2003-02-15 22:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(216134, 12179, 4648, '<td valign="top">Fairly nice job of hiding Waldo.  I would have prefered if he had been hidden more by the water and less by the dark.  But you did a good job of hiding his body with the water, so I''ll give you that.  But it took the dark to hid his head.  I''m torn on that.</td>', 'Fairly nice job of hiding Waldo.  I would have prefered if he had been hidden more by the water and less by the dark.  But you did a good job of hiding his body with the water, so I''ll give you that.  But it took the dark to hid his head.  I''m torn on that.', '2003-02-15 22:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(216138, 12051, 4648, '<td valign="top">Nice photo of a lot of birds.  But I search and searched with a magnifying glass and could not find a human being anywhere. Waldo is a human being.  If I find him later I''ll up the score by 2 points.  I''m probably going to be embarrassed when I do spot him.</td>', 'Nice photo of a lot of birds.  But I search and searched with a magnifying glass and could not find a human being anywhere. Waldo is a human being.  If I find him later I''ll up the score by 2 points.  I''m probably going to be embarrassed when I do spot him.', '2003-02-15 22:45:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(216139, 12234, 4648, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful photo and good job of hiding Waldo in the bushes.  I love this photo.  It is well done and you meet the challenge well.  Congratulations.  Great one.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful photo and good job of hiding Waldo in the bushes.  I love this photo.  It is well done and you meet the challenge well.  Congratulations.  Great one.', '2003-02-15 22:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(216140, 12140, 4648, '<td valign="top">Cute idea and not bad photo, BUT don''t think you hid Waldo at all.  In fact he is the easiest thing to spot in the photo, with all the light being on him.  So personally I don''t feel you met the challenge of hiding Waldo in amongst things, making it difficult to pick him out.</td>', 'Cute idea and not bad photo, BUT don''t think you hid Waldo at all.  In fact he is the easiest thing to spot in the photo, with all the light being on him.  So personally I don''t feel you met the challenge of hiding Waldo in amongst things, making it difficult to pick him out.', '2003-02-15 22:51:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(216141, 12193, 4648, '<td valign="top">Not sure I know what a "bootblack" is.  Is that someone that polishes other peoples shoes?  Is he your Waldo?  In other words, your title could be "Where''s Waldo the bootblack?"  If that''s the case I see him and you did a good job and made a nice photo too.  If I''m correct this is a nice twist to this.  I like it.</td>', 'Not sure I know what a "bootblack" is.  Is that someone that polishes other peoples shoes?  Is he your Waldo?  In other words, your title could be "Where''s Waldo the bootblack?"  If that''s the case I see him and you did a good job and made a nice photo too.  If I''m correct this is a nice twist to this.  I like it.', '2003-02-15 22:58:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(216142, 12094, 4648, '<td valign="top">Heinz "Human" Beans?  Come one.  Get real.  But then, this is a different take on it.  Give you credit for that.  I love the color of this and the focus is fantastic.  The base is a fantastic idea.  This is just a plain old good photo.  Even though I don''t really feel this is what was intended I like it.  Now everyone else is going to stone me.  But this is good.  Have to take off a little for not having a person but you still get an 8.  In other words, it''s a 10 photo.</td>', 'Heinz "Human" Beans?  Come one.  Get real.  But then, this is a different take on it.  Give you credit for that.  I love the color of this and the focus is fantastic.  The base is a fantastic idea.  This is just a plain old good photo.  Even though I don''t really feel this is what was intended I like it.  Now everyone else is going to stone me.  But this is good.  Have to take off a little for not having a person but you still get an 8.  In other words, it''s a 10 photo.', '2003-02-15 23:05:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(216143, 12100, 4648, '<td valign="top">Do you really and honestly think she is hidden?  Yes, she''s beautiful, and I wouldn''t want to hide her either.  But the challenge calls for you to hide her.  This is a beautiful photo of a beautiful little girl, just not quite on the mark for the challenge.</td>', 'Do you really and honestly think she is hidden?  Yes, she''s beautiful, and I wouldn''t want to hide her either.  But the challenge calls for you to hide her.  This is a beautiful photo of a beautiful little girl, just not quite on the mark for the challenge.', '2003-02-15 23:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(216144, 12144, 4648, '<td valign="top">You didn''t even try.  Why?</td>', 'You didn''t even try.  Why?', '2003-02-15 23:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(216145, 12210, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo of a cute little boy, but not for this challenge.  I don''t even understand your title.  This is beautiful, and probably and 8 or 10 for a "cliche" challenge.  For this challenge it is nothing.  And that''s a shame.</td>', 'Beautiful photo of a cute little boy, but not for this challenge.  I don''t even understand your title.  This is beautiful, and probably and 8 or 10 for a "cliche" challenge.  For this challenge it is nothing.  And that''s a shame.', '2003-02-15 23:13:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(216147, 12242, 4648, '<td valign="top">Not sure who''s supposed to be Waldo in this photo.  But I am sure that this photo needs to be focused.  Otherwise decent photo with nice colors and nice composition.  Are you hiding Waldo?  Maybe if it were better focused I could find him.</td>', 'Not sure who''s supposed to be Waldo in this photo.  But I am sure that this photo needs to be focused.  Otherwise decent photo with nice colors and nice composition.  Are you hiding Waldo?  Maybe if it were better focused I could find him.', '2003-02-15 23:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
