(216216, 12170, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great photo. Really nice and clear, with the multiple layers very well positioned within the composition. 10</td>', 'Great photo. Really nice and clear, with the multiple layers very well positioned within the composition. 10', '2003-02-16 08:13:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(216222, 12085, 6709, '<td valign="top">Rich photo...nice use of persepctive. And one of the few that qualifies for this contest. I like the way the human form seems to blend so well with the form of the tree. Still, maybe could have done more to "hide" the person better..perhaps a wider angle, or different cropping?</td>', 'Rich photo...nice use of persepctive. And one of the few that qualifies for this contest. I like the way the human form seems to blend so well with the form of the tree. Still, maybe could have done more to "hide" the person better..perhaps a wider angle, or different cropping?', '2003-02-16 09:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(216223, 12097, 6709, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Good exposure inside and out. There''s something ominous about this photo.  But "Waldo" is too easy to see.</td>', 'Nice shot. Good exposure inside and out. There''s something ominous about this photo.  But "Waldo" is too easy to see.', '2003-02-16 09:27:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(216224, 12093, 6709, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, with its long depth of field and various layers and muted tones. And "Waldo" is done well here - difficult to find, but once you find "him," you know it. Some of the other contributions, Waldo is either way too obvious...or too vague to be sure. This one strikes a good balance.</td>', 'I like this photo, with its long depth of field and various layers and muted tones. And "Waldo" is done well here - difficult to find, but once you find "him," you know it. Some of the other contributions, Waldo is either way too obvious...or too vague to be sure. This one strikes a good balance.', '2003-02-16 09:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(216225, 12194, 6709, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot. Almost looks like a watercolor, especially near the top. I wish the poles weren''t cut off. "Waldo" is a bit too easy to pick out though, yet not very well defined.</td>', 'Very interesting shot. Almost looks like a watercolor, especially near the top. I wish the poles weren''t cut off. "Waldo" is a bit too easy to pick out though, yet not very well defined.', '2003-02-16 09:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(216226, 12212, 6709, '<td valign="top">I like this somewhat "voyeurstic" photo. Waldo is too easy to pick out...but I like it anyway. It''s a bit fuzzy...more DOF would have helped.</td>', 'I like this somewhat "voyeurstic" photo. Waldo is too easy to pick out...but I like it anyway. It''s a bit fuzzy...more DOF would have helped.', '2003-02-16 09:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(216227, 12208, 6709, '<td valign="top">Wow, what a crazy composition. I love it. There is so much going on... Waldo is perfectly hidden. Definitely one of my faves in this round.</td>', 'Wow, what a crazy composition. I love it. There is so much going on... Waldo is perfectly hidden. Definitely one of my faves in this round.', '2003-02-16 09:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(216228, 12295, 6709, '<td valign="top">NIce colors and texture...but the composition just seems too forced.</td>', 'NIce colors and texture...but the composition just seems too forced.', '2003-02-16 09:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(216229, 12059, 6709, '<td valign="top">Cool concept. Nice contrast. I think Waldo is a bit too subtle. Very good effort tho.</td>', 'Cool concept. Nice contrast. I think Waldo is a bit too subtle. Very good effort tho.', '2003-02-16 09:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(216230, 12138, 6709, '<td valign="top">Ah, the ET trick ;)  Waldo is a bit too obvious. Maybe if Waldo was more off-center. Could use a bit more contrast...highlights could be brighter.</td>', 'Ah, the ET trick ;)  Waldo is a bit too obvious. Maybe if Waldo was more off-center. Could use a bit more contrast...highlights could be brighter.', '2003-02-16 09:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(216232, 12171, 6709, '<td valign="top">This is an example where the only way you''d know there was a "Waldo" in the photo was the title...and the contest. Because Waldo is blurry with little detail, it could be a mailbox..or a distant water tower...who knows. Focus seems a little soft as well.</td>', 'This is an example where the only way you''d know there was a "Waldo" in the photo was the title...and the contest. Because Waldo is blurry with little detail, it could be a mailbox..or a distant water tower...who knows. Focus seems a little soft as well.', '2003-02-16 09:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(216234, 12167, 6709, '<td valign="top">Ah, I like this one. Waldo blends into the texture of the photo nicely...which to me should be the goal of this context. "Waldo" isn''t obvious, but you''re sure you''ve seen him once he''s found. Image could use a bit more contrasat, and focus seems a bit soft...but otherwise well done. I like the composition...seems to pull you down the path.</td>', 'Ah, I like this one. Waldo blends into the texture of the photo nicely...which to me should be the goal of this context. "Waldo" isn''t obvious, but you''re sure you''ve seen him once he''s found. Image could use a bit more contrasat, and focus seems a bit soft...but otherwise well done. I like the composition...seems to pull you down the path.', '2003-02-16 09:43:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(216235, 12065, 6709, '<td valign="top">Nice color contrast...but Waldo is front and center, not hidden at all. And the focus is quite soft.</td>', 'Nice color contrast...but Waldo is front and center, not hidden at all. And the focus is quite soft.', '2003-02-16 09:44:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(216236, 12107, 6709, '<td valign="top">What a sky! And the neon in the sign, which usually looks so unnatural, seems to blend with the sky tones so nicely. The stark shadow of the stairway against the sky is a great focal point...and of course there''s our Waldo. Very nice.</td>', 'What a sky! And the neon in the sign, which usually looks so unnatural, seems to blend with the sky tones so nicely. The stark shadow of the stairway against the sky is a great focal point...and of course there''s our Waldo. Very nice.', '2003-02-16 09:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(216238, 12068, 6709, '<td valign="top">Oh, if only there was more depth of field...the focus seems soft overall, especially in the distance. And while there _might_ be a Waldo here, I just can''t be sure. That black speck in the distance? Could be anything...</td>', 'Oh, if only there was more depth of field...the focus seems soft overall, especially in the distance. And while there _might_ be a Waldo here, I just can''t be sure. That black speck in the distance? Could be anything...', '2003-02-16 09:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(216240, 12098, 6709, '<td valign="top">The concept is good...find some way to blend Waldo into the patterns in the photo. But...Waldo is very easy to pick out. And anyway, Waldo isn''t really obviously a person...it could be a sleeping bag...  Also wish the power transformer weren''t in the shot...takes away from the vertical/horizontal line patterns elsewhere.</td>', 'The concept is good...find some way to blend Waldo into the patterns in the photo. But...Waldo is very easy to pick out. And anyway, Waldo isn''t really obviously a person...it could be a sleeping bag...  Also wish the power transformer weren''t in the shot...takes away from the vertical/horizontal line patterns elsewhere.', '2003-02-16 09:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(216242, 12150, 6709, '<td valign="top">Hrm...well, not sure if there is a Waldo in this photo. There is an area with some different coloring...but it isn''t obviously a person. Otherwise, I think the photo could have used more contrast.</td>', 'Hrm...well, not sure if there is a Waldo in this photo. There is an area with some different coloring...but it isn''t obviously a person. Otherwise, I think the photo could have used more contrast.', '2003-02-16 09:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(216261, 12234, 6709, '<td valign="top">Is that a person? Or a tree stump? Hard to tell, unless you know the title of the photo..and even then... Focus is a bit soft.</td>', 'Is that a person? Or a tree stump? Hard to tell, unless you know the title of the photo..and even then... Focus is a bit soft.', '2003-02-16 10:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(216262, 12123, 6709, '<td valign="top">COnsidering this was done in software, Waldo should have been better camoflauged.</td>', 'COnsidering this was done in software, Waldo should have been better camoflauged.', '2003-02-16 10:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(216265, 12099, 6709, '<td valign="top">Hidden? Not really. Waldo is the closest thing to the camera, and therefore quite prominent. Also...it could be a coatrack for all we know. Needs more contrast, and sharper focus.</td>', 'Hidden? Not really. Waldo is the closest thing to the camera, and therefore quite prominent. Also...it could be a coatrack for all we know. Needs more contrast, and sharper focus.', '2003-02-16 10:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(216267, 12158, 6709, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but not very creative. Plus, Waldo is the most obvious thing in the photo...not exactly hidden. Very fuzzy shot.</td>', 'Sorry, but not very creative. Plus, Waldo is the most obvious thing in the photo...not exactly hidden. Very fuzzy shot.', '2003-02-16 10:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(216268, 12256, 6709, '<td valign="top">Not a bad shot - nice lighting. But there''s more than one Waldo...and they''re easy to pick out.</td>', 'Not a bad shot - nice lighting. But there''s more than one Waldo...and they''re easy to pick out.', '2003-02-16 10:46:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(216269, 12225, 6709, '<td valign="top">Ok, I give up. Where IS Waldo? The red crystals? If so, he appears multiple times...which isn''t really what the contest is about. And while some things in this photo look like faces...I just can''t be sure. Focus seems soft.</td>', 'Ok, I give up. Where IS Waldo? The red crystals? If so, he appears multiple times...which isn''t really what the contest is about. And while some things in this photo look like faces...I just can''t be sure. Focus seems soft.', '2003-02-16 10:48:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(216271, 12224, 6709, '<td valign="top">Poorly executed digital merging. The person''s face is very easy to pick out, and the focus on the bg image is fuzzy.</td>', 'Poorly executed digital merging. The person''s face is very easy to pick out, and the focus on the bg image is fuzzy.', '2003-02-16 10:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(216272, 12210, 6709, '<td valign="top">Waldo''s hardly hidden in this one. The flash is a bit harsh - natural light might have worked better. Lacks contrast on the low end.</td>', 'Waldo''s hardly hidden in this one. The flash is a bit harsh - natural light might have worked better. Lacks contrast on the low end.', '2003-02-16 10:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(216275, 12066, 6709, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, interesting composition. But Waldo is farily obvious...and then isn''t obviously a human shape. Could have used more contrast in the image.</td>', 'Nice idea, interesting composition. But Waldo is farily obvious...and then isn''t obviously a human shape. Could have used more contrast in the image.', '2003-02-16 10:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
