(216399, 12221, 4648, '<td valign="top">It''s a fantastically beautiful photo of Waldo''s stuffed animals, but without Waldo it''s worth nothing.  Sorry.  Oops MY BAD.  There''s Waldo.  This is the very best job of hiding Waldo yet.  Boy do I ever feel dumb, I mean really dumb.  This was harder, and better, than the real Waldo ones.  This is also a very fantastic photo, beautiful colors and combination of colors; fantastic focus.  Just over all great job.  This is my only 10.</td>', 'It''s a fantastically beautiful photo of Waldo''s stuffed animals, but without Waldo it''s worth nothing.  Sorry.  Oops MY BAD.  There''s Waldo.  This is the very best job of hiding Waldo yet.  Boy do I ever feel dumb, I mean really dumb.  This was harder, and better, than the real Waldo ones.  This is also a very fantastic photo, beautiful colors and combination of colors; fantastic focus.  Just over all great job.  This is my only 10.', '2003-02-16 18:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(216404, 12298, 4648, '<td valign="top">I hadte to be the one to bring bad knews to you - some of your money is counterfit.  The dimes are not silver, they are made of the same material as your pennies.  Opps so are your nickles.  Better take them back to the bank.  While you are there collect your prize for a fantastic photo of hiding Waldo.  Great one - photo and hiding Waldo.  Good job.</td>', 'I hadte to be the one to bring bad knews to you - some of your money is counterfit.  The dimes are not silver, they are made of the same material as your pennies.  Opps so are your nickles.  Better take them back to the bank.  While you are there collect your prize for a fantastic photo of hiding Waldo.  Great one - photo and hiding Waldo.  Good job.', '2003-02-16 18:22:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(216406, 12059, 4648, '<td valign="top">I can''t find Waldo in any of the raindrops, even with a magnifying glass.  Good job of hiding him, but we are supposed to be able to find him eventually.  Don''t tell me he the shadow through the glass, because in my opinion that doesn''t meed the challenge.  But that''s just my opinion.  But it is a neat photo of the raindrops.</td>', 'I can''t find Waldo in any of the raindrops, even with a magnifying glass.  Good job of hiding him, but we are supposed to be able to find him eventually.  Don''t tell me he the shadow through the glass, because in my opinion that doesn''t meed the challenge.  But that''s just my opinion.  But it is a neat photo of the raindrops.', '2003-02-16 18:36:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(216407, 12107, 4648, '<td valign="top">Hope that''s not waldo up on the landing - becaue that''s not hidden.  Beautiful photo.  I love the coloring.  I also love that we can SEE (?) the sun in this.  Fantastic photo but don''t personally feel you met the challenge of "hiding" Waldo in the photo.  He''s standing right out in the open with nothing hiding him.</td>', 'Hope that''s not waldo up on the landing - becaue that''s not hidden.  Beautiful photo.  I love the coloring.  I also love that we can SEE (?) the sun in this.  Fantastic photo but don''t personally feel you met the challenge of "hiding" Waldo in the photo.  He''s standing right out in the open with nothing hiding him.', '2003-02-16 18:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(216408, 12094, 1570, '<td valign="top">what am i missing here??? oh, i got it now,  i mean, much later and with some help...</td>', 'what am i missing here??? oh, i got it now,  i mean, much later and with some help...', '2003-02-16 18:40:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(216409, 12170, 4648, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful photo.. I''m not sure who you are considering Waldo.  I see three people right off the bat:  one is standing, leaning over the rail on the second landing, one is beside him, and on the bottome right hand corner, there appears to be someone between the railing, which would actually be a better job of hiding.  Or it at least gives the impression of hiding.  Nice one</td>', 'This is a beautiful photo.. I''m not sure who you are considering Waldo.  I see three people right off the bat:  one is standing, leaning over the rail on the second landing, one is beside him, and on the bottome right hand corner, there appears to be someone between the railing, which would actually be a better job of hiding.  Or it at least gives the impression of hiding.  Nice one', '2003-02-16 18:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(216410, 12157, 4648, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo.  Love how you start at the very bottome with the water and follow it all the way to the ocean.  Great job of focus.  Good composition nicely executed&gt;  BUT , and I''m as tired of writing this as others will be of reading it once the challenge ends, I personally feel you have not meet the challenge.  Waldo was/is to be HIDDEN in among he people, places, and things.  I understand your thinking.  But to me, putting Waldo way off by himself does not meet the challenge of hiding him.  But I dolove the hoto other wise.</td>', 'Beautiful photo.  Love how you start at the very bottome with the water and follow it all the way to the ocean.  Great job of focus.  Good composition nicely executed>  BUT , and I''m as tired of writing this as others will be of reading it once the challenge ends, I personally feel you have not meet the challenge.  Waldo was/is to be HIDDEN in among he people, places, and things.  I understand your thinking.  But to me, putting Waldo way off by himself does not meet the challenge of hiding him.  But I dolove the hoto other wise.', '2003-02-16 18:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(216414, 12237, 4648, '<td valign="top">Oh, so cute.  Don''t have any idea how you did the eyes, but obviously it''s legal and I love it.  In fact I love the whole photo.  Nicely done with one exception, WHERE"S WALDO!..You did too good of a job of hiding him.  I can''t even find him with a magnifying glass.  BUT the whole thing is that we are supposed to be able to find him, just barely but do find.  If I cand find Waldo I''ll up your score by 2 points.  Because, to me personally, if Wald''s not here you haven''t meet the challenge.  I thought for a minute you had hidden him with the precious moments kids, but no.  that would have been a neat place to hide him.  If I find him later I''ll increase the score by 2.</td>', 'Oh, so cute.  Don''t have any idea how you did the eyes, but obviously it''s legal and I love it.  In fact I love the whole photo.  Nicely done with one exception, WHERE"S WALDO!..You did too good of a job of hiding him.  I can''t even find him with a magnifying glass.  BUT the whole thing is that we are supposed to be able to find him, just barely but do find.  If I cand find Waldo I''ll up your score by 2 points.  Because, to me personally, if Wald''s not here you haven''t meet the challenge.  I thought for a minute you had hidden him with the precious moments kids, but no.  that would have been a neat place to hide him.  If I find him later I''ll increase the score by 2.', '2003-02-16 19:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(216415, 12122, 4648, '<td valign="top">You need to pay attention to details, such as a straight and smooth background.  That would have improved this photo immensely.  You need better, more evenly distributed light.  Personally I don''t like the way you hid Waldo.  But that''s just me.  It''s nothing like the Waldo books way of hiding him - out in the open but so hard to spot, among all the other people, places, and things.</td>', 'You need to pay attention to details, such as a straight and smooth background.  That would have improved this photo immensely.  You need better, more evenly distributed light.  Personally I don''t like the way you hid Waldo.  But that''s just me.  It''s nothing like the Waldo books way of hiding him - out in the open but so hard to spot, among all the other people, places, and things.', '2003-02-16 19:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(216419, 12065, 4648, '<td valign="top">At first I thought this was oranges laying on the ground.  But when looking through the magnifying glass for Waldo I realized they are flowers.  They are beautiful.  The main problem with the photo is obvious, the shadow.  It dominates the photo.  I do hope you don''t mean the shadow to be Waldo hiding.  That is definitely not hidden.  Anyway I don''t recognize the flowers, but they are really pretty, almost like a poppy.  As for the challenge, I can''t find Waldo.  If I find him at a later time I will add 2 points.</td>', 'At first I thought this was oranges laying on the ground.  But when looking through the magnifying glass for Waldo I realized they are flowers.  They are beautiful.  The main problem with the photo is obvious, the shadow.  It dominates the photo.  I do hope you don''t mean the shadow to be Waldo hiding.  That is definitely not hidden.  Anyway I don''t recognize the flowers, but they are really pretty, almost like a poppy.  As for the challenge, I can''t find Waldo.  If I find him at a later time I will add 2 points.', '2003-02-16 19:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(216422, 12063, 4648, '<td valign="top">Can''t tell which way he went.  Even with the magnifying glass I couldn''t distinguish a direction from the gloves he left showing where he went.  EXCEPT that with the highest magnification part, it appears to be one glove and one man on the sticks.  Now that was very difficult to spot.  Without that strong of a magnifier I would never have spotted that.  Good job.</td>', 'Can''t tell which way he went.  Even with the magnifying glass I couldn''t distinguish a direction from the gloves he left showing where he went.  EXCEPT that with the highest magnification part, it appears to be one glove and one man on the sticks.  Now that was very difficult to spot.  Without that strong of a magnifier I would never have spotted that.  Good job.', '2003-02-16 19:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(216462, 12169, 6740, '<td valign="top">This photo relates to the topic of "Where''s Waldo, unlike so many other.<br/>Color is a bit off but otherwise nice.</td>', 'This photo relates to the topic of "Where''s Waldo, unlike so many other.Color is a bit off but otherwise nice.', '2003-02-16 21:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(216463, 12194, 6740, '<td valign="top">Detailed,  peaceful,  makes you wonder where everybody is.</td>', 'Detailed,  peaceful,  makes you wonder where everybody is.', '2003-02-16 21:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(216464, 12262, 6740, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, rates a high vote.</td>', 'Nicely done, rates a high vote.', '2003-02-16 21:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(216467, 12251, 6740, '<td valign="top">Pretty setting, like the colors, well done.</td>', 'Pretty setting, like the colors, well done.', '2003-02-16 21:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(216472, 12250, 1280, '<td valign="top">I scored this highest of al the similar images.  The expression on the child is very cute, and the image is nice and bright.  It is a bit flat...no shadows.  Composition is nice that you don''t have the cute baby centered.</td>', 'I scored this highest of al the similar images.  The expression on the child is very cute, and the image is nice and bright.  It is a bit flat...no shadows.  Composition is nice that you don''t have the cute baby centered.', '2003-02-16 21:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(216473, 12167, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like your perspective, and the trees have a beautifully aged appearance.  It reminds me of one of my favorite places on earth...the Bronx Zoo.  www.wcs.org.  Nice comp, well exposed, good choice of b &amp; w.  Good luck!</td>', 'I like your perspective, and the trees have a beautifully aged appearance.  It reminds me of one of my favorite places on earth...the Bronx Zoo.  www.wcs.org.  Nice comp, well exposed, good choice of b & w.  Good luck!', '2003-02-16 21:30:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(216474, 12122, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like this.  Good job!  I appreciate the barely there appearance, and the composition works well.</td>', 'I like this.  Good job!  I appreciate the barely there appearance, and the composition works well.', '2003-02-16 21:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(216475, 12085, 1280, '<td valign="top">I like how you incorporated the human limb, into the tree limbs.  Very creative approach.</td>', 'I like how you incorporated the human limb, into the tree limbs.  Very creative approach.', '2003-02-16 21:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(216476, 12155, 1647, '<td valign="top">What an interesting photo.  It looks like several of the walls, columns and background are painted in the enclosure.  Is the person really in with the giraffe?  The colours have a lovely soft pastel feel to them - Good work.  You probably could have had the child hidden a little more, but that doesn''t change my vote in this instance.</td>', 'What an interesting photo.  It looks like several of the walls, columns and background are painted in the enclosure.  Is the person really in with the giraffe?  The colours have a lovely soft pastel feel to them - Good work.  You probably could have had the child hidden a little more, but that doesn''t change my vote in this instance.', '2003-02-16 21:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(216477, 12276, 1647, '<td valign="top">Nice photo - reminds me of a butterfly enclosure at a nearby zoo.</td>', 'Nice photo - reminds me of a butterfly enclosure at a nearby zoo.', '2003-02-16 21:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(216485, 12147, 3280, '<td valign="top">Good Waldoing.  Hidden nicely but easy to find as well.  I like the composition and the way that your lines lead to the leg.  Good job.</td>', 'Good Waldoing.  Hidden nicely but easy to find as well.  I like the composition and the way that your lines lead to the leg.  Good job.', '2003-02-16 22:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(216486, 12142, 3280, '<td valign="top">Super shot, one of my favorites.  I like the tone and feel of it.  I also like your use of negative space. Good job</td>', 'Super shot, one of my favorites.  I like the tone and feel of it.  I also like your use of negative space. Good job', '2003-02-16 22:25:27.000000', NULL, 1),
