(216489, 12148, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very cool, the orientation makes it.  Great focus, lighting and color, one of my favorites for the challenge.</td>', 'Very cool, the orientation makes it.  Great focus, lighting and color, one of my favorites for the challenge.', '2003-02-16 22:26:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(216490, 12122, 3280, '<td valign="top">Really well done, I love the B &amp; W and the feel and tone of the shot. Great job, one of my favorites this week.</td>', 'Really well done, I love the B & W and the feel and tone of the shot. Great job, one of my favorites this week.', '2003-02-16 22:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(216493, 12053, 3280, '<td valign="top">All those naked models!!!  Very good job of hiding "Waldo" and let him be seen too.  Good lighting and tone.  One of my favorites this week.</td>', 'All those naked models!!!  Very good job of hiding "Waldo" and let him be seen too.  Good lighting and tone.  One of my favorites this week.', '2003-02-16 22:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(216495, 12179, 3280, '<td valign="top">Very nice, the expression on "Waldo''s" face makes the shot.  The shot seems a little yellow or orange but excellent nonetheless.</td>', 'Very nice, the expression on "Waldo''s" face makes the shot.  The shot seems a little yellow or orange but excellent nonetheless.', '2003-02-16 22:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(216496, 12133, 3280, '<td valign="top">The best of the stuffed animal shots IMHO.  I wish I could see all of the eye though.</td>', 'The best of the stuffed animal shots IMHO.  I wish I could see all of the eye though.', '2003-02-16 22:30:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(216497, 12281, 3280, '<td valign="top">This is really neat, I''ll be glad to see how you did it.  Great job.  A bit too much on the shadows but I wonder if that was necessary.</td>', 'This is really neat, I''ll be glad to see how you did it.  Great job.  A bit too much on the shadows but I wonder if that was necessary.', '2003-02-16 22:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(216498, 12233, 3280, '<td valign="top">Really good job.  I just wish that the squares were lined up with the border better.</td>', 'Really good job.  I just wish that the squares were lined up with the border better.', '2003-02-16 22:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(216499, 12091, 3280, '<td valign="top">Great title and shot although a bit haunting.  One of my favorites this week. The only thing I would change is the border.  I don''t like the "buttonized" look.  I didn''t mark it down because of it however.</td>', 'Great title and shot although a bit haunting.  One of my favorites this week. The only thing I would change is the border.  I don''t like the "buttonized" look.  I didn''t mark it down because of it however.', '2003-02-16 22:33:16.000000', NULL, 1),
