(216585, 12224, 6392, '<td valign="top">It seems that there were many who loved and many who hated this image. I thank you all.<br/> <br/> Technically it was nothing more than a slide projection over the subject.<br/></td>', 'It seems that there were many who loved and many who hated this image. I thank you all.  Technically it was nothing more than a slide projection over the subject.', '2003-02-17 00:15:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(216595, 12179, 5212, '<td valign="top">Critque Club:<br/> <br/>Meets the Challenge:  Well done! I love the way the water "points" to "waldo" "helping" us find him!<br/> <br/>Composition: Good.  Excellent timing of the shot and the pose is perfect for partially showing the man.<br/> <br/>Technical Quality: Well done. Image clear enough considering the difficulty of shot.  No post-processing problems noted.  I wonder what this shot would have looked like with a slower shutter speed so the water didn''t look so much like fireworks??<br/> <br/>Creativity: Excellent. Not another shot like it in the challenge, for sure.<br/> <br/>Overall Conclusion:  Great photo, not much to criticize, for sure.  <br/> <br/>If you have questions, feel free to write.  Sorry I didn''t have much different than other people noted below.<br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'Critque Club: Meets the Challenge:  Well done! I love the way the water "points" to "waldo" "helping" us find him! Composition: Good.  Excellent timing of the shot and the pose is perfect for partially showing the man. Technical Quality: Well done. Image clear enough considering the difficulty of shot.  No post-processing problems noted.  I wonder what this shot would have looked like with a slower shutter speed so the water didn''t look so much like fireworks?? Creativity: Excellent. Not another shot like it in the challenge, for sure. Overall Conclusion:  Great photo, not much to criticize, for sure.   If you have questions, feel free to write.  Sorry I didn''t have much different than other people noted below.  ', '2003-02-17 00:20:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(216615, 12142, 2700, '<td valign="top">damn should have won...</td>', 'damn should have won...', '2003-02-17 00:28:56.000000', NULL, 0),
